  <data key="d2">Degirmenci N. is a researcher who investigated the utilization of phosphogypsum as raw and calcined material in manufacturing building products.&lt;SEP&gt;Degirmenci N. is a researcher who investigated the utilization of phosphogypsum as raw and calcined material in manufacturing building products.&lt;SEP&gt;Degirmenci N. is a researcher who investigated the utilization of phosphogypsum as raw and calcined material in manufacturing building products.</data>
