<node id="Ennaciri Y.">
  <data key="d0">Ennaciri Y.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Ennaciri Y. is a researcher who designed procedures to convert phosphogypsum waste into valuable industrial products.&lt;SEP&gt;Ennaciri Y. is a researcher who designed procedures to convert phosphogypsum waste into valuable industrial products.&lt;SEP&gt;Ennaciri Y. is a researcher who designed procedures to convert phosphogypsum waste into valuable industrial products.</data>
