  <data key="d0">Garg M.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Garg M. is a researcher who focused on developing alpha plaster from phosphogypsum for use as cementitious binders.&lt;SEP&gt;Garg M. is a researcher who focused on developing alpha plaster from phosphogypsum for use as cementitious binders.&lt;SEP&gt;Garg M. is a researcher who focused on developing alpha plaster from phosphogypsum for use as cementitious binders.</data>
