  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Van Driessche A.E.S. is a researcher who studied the role of bassanite as a stable precursor phase in gypsum precipitation.&lt;SEP&gt;Van Driessche A.E.S. is a researcher who studied the role of bassanite as a stable precursor phase in gypsum precipitation.&lt;SEP&gt;Van Driessche A.E.S. is a researcher who studied the role of bassanite as a stable precursor phase in gypsum precipitation.</data>
