<node id="Bassanite">
  <data key="d0">Bassanite</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Bassanite is a calcium sulfate mineral identified as a stable precursor phase in the precipitation of gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Bassanite is a calcium sulfate mineral identified as a stable precursor phase in the precipitation of gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Bassanite is a calcium sulfate hemihydrate compound identified as a species within phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Bassanite is a calcium sulfate compound that primarily composes phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Bassanite is a calcium sulfate mineral identified as a stable precursor phase in the precipitation of gypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-015</data>
