<node id="Gypsum">
  <data key="d0">Gypsum</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Gypsum (CaSO4·2H2O) is a calcium sulfate dihydrate mineral characterized by elongated, prismatic, or needle-like crystals that aggregate into dense, fibrous structures. Its precipitation and crystallization are heavily influenced by precursor phases like bassanite and various crystal modifiers, often forming as the main crystalline phase during setting reactions. Physically, gypsum shares properties with phosphogypsum, and its solubility product has been estimated. It constitutes over 90 percent of phosphogypsum, a solid byproduct of fluorapatite acidulation for phosphoric acid production, serving as its primary chemical and mineral matrix.

Within this matrix, gypsum’s crystal lattice readily accommodates sulfate and hydrogen phosphate substitution, allows for the substitution or adsorption of various trace elements, and can trap uranium within its lattice or adsorb uranyl ions on its surface. Consequently, gypsum acts as a principal host matrix for rare earth elements, making its dissolution a critical prerequisite for their recovery. While its solubility in acid systems is actively modeled, its crystalline structure often impedes dissolution, necessitating targeted breakdown strategies. Conversely, in alkaline processing applications such as EDTA treatment, gypsum dissolves to solubilize associated rare earth elements, thereby increasing their concentration while simultaneously reducing calcium oxide and sulfur trioxide levels in the resulting waste solution, during which the gypsum is also purified. Gypsum frequently undergoes recrystallization during acid leaching, hydrothermal treatments, or pre-treatment, often reacting with silica and aluminum impurities to form complex phases, and it is also studied for its coprecipitation properties with various elements in experimental research.

Beyond its environmental and industrial roles in phosphogypsum management and rare earth extraction, gypsum holds extensive utility across multiple sectors. It is routinely incorporated into building materials and serves vital functions in cement manufacturing, acting as a standard retarder in Portland slag cement and as the sole calcium oxide source in specialized formulations. It is also identified as a major mineral and mixed phase within composite bone cement samples, consistently detected via X-ray diffraction. Furthermore, gypsum is widely utilized as a soil amendment to ameliorate acid soils, improve overall soil properties and tillage ease, and enhance crop growth.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-00