<node id="Wet Conversion">
  <data key="d0">Wet Conversion</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Wet conversion is a chemical processing method used to extract valuable compounds like potassium sulfate from phosphogypsum and synthetic gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wet conversion is a chemical processing method used to extract valuable compounds like potassium sulfate from phosphogypsum and synthetic gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wet conversion is a chemical synthesis method used to produce potassium sulfate from phosphogypsum and synthetic gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Wet conversion is a chemical processing method used to extract valuable compounds like potassium sulfate from phosphogypsum and synthetic gypsum.</data>
