<node id="Construct. Build. Mater.">
  <data key="d0">Construct. Build. Mater.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Construct. Build. Mater. is a scientific and academic journal dedicated to publishing research and studies in the field of construction and building materials engineering. A central theme of its publication portfolio is the investigation, modification, purification, and practical utilization of phosphogypsum, a common industrial byproduct. The journal consistently features comprehensive studies that explore advanced methods for processing this material and integrating it into diverse engineering contexts.

Specific research published in Construct. Build. Mater. spans a wide array of construction applications and material science topics. These include the development of phosphogypsum-modified cement, supersulfated cement, and phosphogypsum composites, as well as its application in clay bricks, aerated concrete, mortar, and insulation materials. Additionally, the journal covers the mechanical properties of alkali-activated systems, the recycling of waste gypsum, and the use of these materials in road base construction. By consolidating investigations into both the chemical modification of phosphogypsum and its practical deployment, the journal serves as a vital resource for advancements in sustainable construction and building material engineering.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-017</data>
