</node>
<node id="Potassium Sulfate">
  <data key="d0">Potassium Sulfate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Potassium sulfate is a versatile chemical compound and industrial raw material that functions primarily as a water-soluble potassium fertilizer and valuable agricultural input. It is predominantly derived from phosphogypsum, as well as synthetic gypsum, through several distinct industrial processing pathways. Across these varied manufacturing routes, the compound consistently maintains its dual role as a critical chemical raw material for industrial applications and an effective, water-soluble potassium fertilizer for agricultural use.

The production of potassium sulfate typically involves wet or aqueous conversion methods, where phosphogypsum undergoes co-reaction with potassium feldspar or reacts directly with potassium chloride. In alternative processing contexts, it is generated as a byproduct during the treatment of washed phosphogypsum with potassium hydroxide within a thermostatic jacket. Following these respective chemical reactions, the compound is consistently isolated and purified through filtration and separation techniques. These approaches highlight its efficient synthesis from mineral and industrial sources while ensuring high purity for its intended commercial and agricultural applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-012</data>
