  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Bubbling is a carbonation process applied to the PGA solid phase, yielding the PGAB solid phase and liquid waste.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-026</data>
