  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Filtration">
  <data key="d0">Filtration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Filtration is a separation process used to isolate potassium sulfate and calcium carbonate-rich slag.&lt;SEP&gt;Filtration is a separation technique used during hydrolysis to remove slightly soluble and insoluble impurities.&lt;SEP&gt;Filtration is the physical separation method used to isolate crystallized gypsum from the liquid phase.&lt;SEP&gt;Filtration is a processing method used to separate solids from fluids, often involving pressure differentials.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791209349</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diffusion">
  <data key="d0">Diffusion</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Diffusion is a passive transport mechanism for gases moving through soil and water layers.&lt;SEP&gt;Diffusion is a physical mechanism through which methane escapes from flooded soil into the atmosphere.&lt;SEP&gt;Diffusion is a physical process facilitating methane release from flooded soils.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-026</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1790942862</data>
