<node id="Building Materials">
  <data key="d0">Building Materials</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Building Materials constitute a fundamental category of construction products designed for structural and functional use within the built environment. They serve as the primary application field, sector, and comprehensive utilization pathway for phosphogypsum, encompassing its purified, processed, and phosphate gypsum derivatives. By manufacturing construction products such as gypsum blocks, boards, and cement mortar using these industrial byproducts, the sector plays a crucial role in alleviating material shortages and promoting the sustainable utilization of phosphogypsum.

Despite their technical viability and resource efficiency, the commercial deployment of phosphogypsum-based Building Materials encounters notable hurdles, as market acceptance is frequently constrained by public perception regarding safety and environmental impact. Furthermore, because these construction products often incorporate industrial residues, they function as the primary context for applying Radium Equivalent (Ra-Eq) calculations. These assessments are essential for evaluating radioactivity levels and ensuring that the final products meet established safety and regulatory standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Building materials are a common application for Phosphogypsum, though limited by regional market demand.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-000</data>
