<node id="Dissolution Crystallization">
  <data key="d0">Dissolution Crystallization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Dissolution crystallization is a utilization mechanism where Phosphogypsum dissolves in water, releases impurities, and recrystallizes into pure calcium sulfate-based materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Dissolution crystallization is a utilization mechanism where Phosphogypsum dissolves in water, releases impurities, and recrystallizes into pure calcium sulfate-based materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Dissolution crystallization is a utilization mechanism where Phosphogypsum dissolves in water, releases impurities, and recrystallizes into pure calcium sulfate-based materials.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791120229</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dehydration Rehydration">
  <data key="d0">Dehydration Rehydration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Dehydration rehydration is a mechanism where Phosphogypsum's main component undergoes water removal and subsequent rehydration to form high-performance materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Dehydration rehydration is a mechanism where Phosphogypsum's main component undergoes water removal and subsequent rehydration to form high-performance materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Dehydration rehydration is a mechanism where Phosphogypsum's main component undergoes water removal and subsequent rehydration to form high-performance materials.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005</data>
