<node id="Cement">
  <data key="d0">Cement</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cement is a fundamental binding material and the primary construction binder extensively utilized across the building industry. Its material composition typically incorporates calcite alongside other processed compounds, with the cement sector serving as a major application domain for the final calcite product. To optimize structural performance, cement is frequently modified, stabilized, or combined with supplementary substances, and it can also be blended with various solid wastes. A notable characteristic of modern cement production is its integration with phosphogypsum, an industrial byproduct that functions as a primary calcium oxide source. When phosphogypsum is employed, cement can be coproduced alongside sulfuric acid. Although phosphogypsum has historically been applied in cement manufacturing, the broader promotion and industrial scaling of this practice remain hindered by the high decomposition temperatures required during processing.

Within the framework of the PSC technology, cement is recovered as a co-produced material that accounts for a minor fraction of provincial production. Specific operational records indicate a production quantity of 533.00 kg for this process. The integration of cement into the PSC system adds economic value to the overall product output and serves as a substitution factor designed to reduce environmental impact. Additionally, cement is formally cataloged and listed in relevant technical documentation and reference tables.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-016</data>
