<node id="Calcium Sulfate Whiskers">
  <data key="d0">Calcium Sulfate Whiskers</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Calcium Sulfate Whiskers are fine crystalline fibers and high-value chemical raw materials primarily derived from phosphogypsum, which serves as their main component. These engineered materials are specifically developed to function as valuable industrial feedstocks and reinforcing agents.

The whiskers exhibit a robust set of physical and chemical properties, most notably high temperature resistance, strong resistance to chemical corrosion, and a strong affinity for polymers. Owing to these characteristics, Calcium Sulfate Whiskers are extensively utilized across various industrial applications to enhance material durability and performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium sulfate whiskers are fine crystalline fibers prepared from phosphogypsum for industrial applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium sulfate whiskers are crystalline materials prepared using Phosphogypsum as the main component.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium Sulfate Whiskers are high-value materials derived from phosphogypsum, known for high temperature resistance, chemical corrosion resistance, and strong polymer affinity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-001</data>
