  <data key="d2">Solid waste represents the public perception category that creates market resistance against Phosphogypsum-based building materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Solid waste represents the public perception category that creates market resistance against Phosphogypsum-based building materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Solid waste represents the public perception category that creates market resistance against Phosphogypsum-based building materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Solid waste is a soil emission listed in the emissions table.&lt;SEP&gt;A byproduct of all three processes that is 100% reused.</data>
