<node id="Environmental Protection">
  <data key="d0">Environmental Protection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Environmental protection awareness acts as a societal constraint on Phosphogypsum utilization, requiring government support for breakthroughs.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental protection is realized through the extraction of rare and precious heavy metals from solid wastes.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental protection awareness acts as a societal constraint on Phosphogypsum utilization, requiring government support for breakthroughs.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental protection is realized through the extraction of rare and precious heavy metals from solid wastes.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental protection awareness acts as a societal constraint on Phosphogypsum utilization, requiring government support for breakthroughs.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental protection is realized through the extraction of rare and precious heavy metals from solid wastes.</data>
