<node id="Chemical Raw Materials">
  <data key="d0">Chemical Raw Materials</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemical Raw Materials represent a primary application pathway and major utilization domain for phosphogypsum, a byproduct characterized by its high calcium and sulfur content. This sector serves as a critical field for resource recovery, transforming phosphogypsum into valuable industrial inputs through targeted chemical processing. By leveraging the mineral composition of phosphogypsum, this application domain effectively converts a typically discarded material into essential chemical resources.

The processing of phosphogypsum within this sector yields a range of industrial products, most notably sulfuric acid and potassium sulfate, along with various other chemical compounds. These synthesized materials function as fundamental industrial inputs for diverse manufacturing and production activities. Consequently, the Chemical Raw Materials sector plays a vital role in sustainable resource management by establishing a closed-loop utilization pathway that maximizes the economic and industrial value of phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005</data>
