<node id="Nano-CaSO4">
  <data key="d0">Nano-CaSO4</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Nano-CaSO4 is a nanomaterial and chemical compound synthesized from phosphogypsum using an economical and highly applicable method. This preparation process facilitates the comprehensive utilization of phosphogypsum, effectively transforming an industrial byproduct into a valuable resource. The development of Nano-CaSO4 highlights a sustainable approach to material production, emphasizing cost-effectiveness and practical scalability.

In addition to its production advantages, Nano-CaSO4 serves distinct industrial applications. It is specifically utilized as a functional component within industrial polymer composites, where its nanoscale properties enhance material performance. By bridging sustainable resource recovery with advanced manufacturing needs, Nano-CaSO4 represents a versatile solution in modern materials science.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-008</data>
