<node id="Fertilizers">
  <data key="d0">Fertilizers</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Fertilizers represent one of the industrial sectors where the final Calcite product is applied.&lt;SEP&gt;Agricultural inputs containing cadmium that contribute to soil accumulation and environmental risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Agricultural products that utilize calcite and other processed materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Agricultural inputs containing cadmium that contribute to soil accumulation and environmental risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial products manufactured using phosphoric acid, associated with the generation of phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Fertilizers containing calcium, potassium, phosphorus, and silicon are listed as agricultural amendments.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
