  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agriculture">
  <data key="d0">Agriculture</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Agriculture serves as a critical downstream sector where fertilizers are applied to support crop cultivation. This sector is frequently depicted in diagrams and conceptual models with imagery of tractors working in green fields, which establishes the foundational context for fertilizer production and resource application. As a fundamental component of the food supply chain, agriculture functions as the primary destination for various processed materials and industrial byproducts.

A major focus within this sector is the utilization of specific valorized resources. Agriculture represents a primary application pathway and key application area for phosphogypsum, a material whose agricultural use has been extensively reviewed in research literature. Furthermore, the sector is a key application domain for calcite, a product derived from valorization processes, as well as other processed materials. Collectively, these applications underscore agriculture's vital role in integrating industrial recycling efforts with sustainable crop cultivation practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Agriculture represents a primary application pathway for phosphogypsum resource utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Agriculture is one of the primary sectors for Phosphogypsum utilization in major producing countries.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791208777</data>
