<node id="Hydrothermal Synthesis">
  <data key="d0">Hydrothermal Synthesis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydrothermal Synthesis is a chemical process typically conducted under controlled temperature and pressure conditions to facilitate the crystallization and formation of various materials. This technique serves as a versatile method for engineering nanomaterials and functional crystals, operating in aqueous environments to promote the growth of structured compounds from dissolved precursors.

The process is widely utilized to prepare specific crystalline structures, such as calcium sulfate whiskers, and to synthesize hierarchical nanoflowers, including calcium fluoride (CaF2) and lanthanide-doped calcium fluoride (CaF2:Ln3+). It is also frequently applied to valorize industrial byproducts and waste streams, notably for producing nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite from phosphogypsum waste, as well as for generating other nanocrystalline materials from various waste sources. In targeted chemical formulations, Hydrothermal Synthesis enables the coprecipitation of calcium and rare earth elements (REEs) in the presence of complexing agents and fluorine, such as EDTA and fluorine compounds. Overall, Hydrothermal Synthesis functions as a robust synthetic pathway for creating diverse nanostructured and crystalline products from both conventional precursors and recycled feedstocks.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal synthesis is a common technique exhibited for preparing calcium sulfate whiskers under controlled temperature and pressure.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal Synthesis is a process used to produce nanocrystalline hydroxyapatite from phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal synthesis is a chemical process used to produce nanocrystalline materials from waste sources.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
