  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Pyrolysis is a thermal decomposition process applied to phosphogypsum to extract sulfur-containing chemical raw materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Pyrolysis is a thermal decomposition process applied to phosphogypsum to extract sulfur-containing chemical raw materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Pyrolysis is a thermal decomposition process applied to phosphogypsum to extract sulfur-containing chemical raw materials.</data>
