  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">CO2 Capture is an environmental process aimed at capturing carbon dioxide emissions, explored in conjunction with phosphogypsum decomposition products.&lt;SEP&gt;CO2 Capture is an environmental process aimed at capturing carbon dioxide emissions, explored in conjunction with phosphogypsum decomposition products.&lt;SEP&gt;CO2 Capture is an environmental process aimed at capturing carbon dioxide emissions, explored in conjunction with phosphogypsum decomposition products.</data>
