  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Plasterboard is a high-strength, fiber-free building material produced using phosphogypsum as a primary component.&lt;SEP&gt;Plasterboard is a high-strength, fiber-free building material produced using phosphogypsum as a primary component.&lt;SEP&gt;A building material whose development and application utilize phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Plasterboard is a high-strength, fiber-free building material produced using phosphogypsum as a primary component.</data>
