<node id="J. Hazard Mater.">
  <data key="d0">J. Hazard Mater.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">J. Hazard Mater. is a scientific journal dedicated to publishing research on hazardous materials. It serves as a primary platform for academic and industrial studies aimed at understanding, managing, and mitigating the impacts of hazardous substances.

The journal has featured extensive research on phosphogypsum, a byproduct requiring careful handling. Published studies have explored the microencapsulation and characterization of phosphogypsum, alongside investigations into its modification for enhanced utility. Furthermore, the publication has highlighted efforts to valorize phosphogypsum as a hydraulic binder in construction applications. Research featured in the journal also addresses environmental remediation, particularly focusing on heavy metal adsorption processes. Collectively, these contributions underscore the journal's commitment to advancing knowledge in hazardous material science and sustainable waste management.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-017</data>
