  <data key="d2">A silicon-oxygen-hydrogen species released during the hydrolysis of the solid phase, likely representing orthosilicic acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Silicic Acid is a dissolved silica compound produced during the reaction, relevant to element leaching.</data>
