<node id="Phosphoric Acid">
  <data key="d0">Phosphoric Acid</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphoric acid is a strategic, water-soluble industrial chemical compound and the primary product extracted from phosphate rock, such as apatite, through wet-process acidulation with sulfuric acid. The conventional manufacturing pathway yields hydrofluoric acid as a valuable co-product and phosphogypsum as a major solid by-product and waste material. Within this industrial ecosystem, the compound also defines a production sector that frequently recycles sulfuric acid recovered from phosphogypsum processing to sustain ongoing operations. Alternatively, phosphoric acid can be generated or recovered through specialized chemical methods, including the reaction of thorium(IV) phosphate with sulfuric acid or the extraction of phosphate impurities from phosphogypsum using aqueous citric acid.

Chemically and environmentally, phosphoric acid serves as the liquid phase produced during acidulation, acting as a critical partitioning medium where most uranium, heavy rare earth elements, and specific radionuclides, including Pb-210, are preferentially concentrated. Depending on operational parameters, specific recovery processes can capture between 20% and 30% of the system's total rare earth content. Conversely, within the phosphogypsum by-product, phosphoric acid persists as a primary residual impurity in various ionic forms, residing within the material's pores and significantly influencing its chemical composition, overall acidity, and acidic nature. Regardless of the production or recovery pathway, the final compound typically contains residual impurities that necessitate rigorous purification to ensure safe and effective utilization.

Central to global fertilizer production and broader industrial applications, phosphoric acid functions as a vital precursor for white phosphorus synthesis, fluorine separation, and rare earth element extraction. In manufacturing and processing contexts, it acts as an acid that directly influences crystal morphology and affects filtration flow rates. Due to its strategic importance and complex environmental interactions, phosphoric acid remains a focal point for ongoing market analysis, synthesis research, and chemical engineering studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphoric acid is a harmful free acid present in phosphogypsum that reacts with quicklime to form inert salts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-002</data>
