<node id="Chemical Equation">
  <data key="d0">Chemical Equation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A symbolic representation of chemical reactions, including reactants, products, and reaction arrows, as analyzed in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;A symbolic representation of the decomposition reaction of tricalcium hexaaluminate hydrate.&lt;SEP&gt;The chemical equation mathematically represents the balanced reaction of fluorapatite acidulation and tracks rare earth element distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;A balanced representation of the carbothermal reduction reaction showing reactants and products.</data>
