  <data key="d2">Sodium dodecyl sulfonate is a chemical modifier used alongside phosphogypsum to create exclusive adsorption materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium dodecyl sulfonate is a chemical modifier used alongside phosphogypsum to create exclusive adsorption materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium dodecyl sulfonate is a chemical modifier used alongside phosphogypsum to create exclusive adsorption materials.</data>
