<node id="Copper">
  <data key="d0">Copper</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Copper is a chemical element classified as a heavy metal pollutant and trace element, with its properties and applications examined across geological, industrial, and environmental contexts. In phosphogypsum systems, copper is present as a trace element with concentrations that exceed natural geological baselines. Specifically, in South African phosphogypsum, measured mass contents range from 24.72 to 28.00 μg/g, and the element demonstrates a transfer rate of 64–100 percent during processing. Conversely, copper is depleted in phosphorites relative to crustal abundances and is commonly associated with organic matter. Within these industrial byproducts, copper concentration decreases significantly alongside cadmium as pH levels rise. Furthermore, copper can be combined with phosphogypsum to synthesize a compound oxygen carrier that effectively lowers reaction temperatures.

From an environmental and regulatory standpoint, copper is strictly controlled as a heavy metal pollutant in both surface water and irrigation water quality standards. Regulatory frameworks explicitly list copper with defined concentration limits, establishing a maximum allowable level of 1 mg L⁻¹. To mitigate its environmental impact, copper is actively targeted for removal from contaminated water sources using phosphogypsum-based adsorption materials, which have proven to achieve high removal efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Copper is a metal resource whose atmospheric discharge is a key factor for terrestrial ecotoxicity potential.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-047&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-006</data>
