<node id="Hydroxyapatite Nanoparticles">
  <data key="d0">Hydroxyapatite Nanoparticles</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydroxyapatite nanoparticles are advanced materials derived from phosphogypsum for treating fluoride-polluted wastewater.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite Nanoparticles are synthesized from waste phosphogypsum for applications in fluoride removal from aqueous solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite nanoparticles are advanced materials derived from phosphogypsum for treating fluoride-polluted wastewater.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite Nanoparticles are synthesized from waste phosphogypsum for applications in fluoride removal from aqueous solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite nanoparticles are synthesized from waste phosphogypsum for applications in removing fluoride from water.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite nanoparticles are advanced materials derived from phosphogypsum for treating fluoride-polluted wastewater.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite Nanoparticles are synthesized from waste phosphogypsum for applications in fluoride removal from aqueous solutions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-024</data>
