  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">α-Hemihydrate is a high-strength cementitious material with superior workability and mechanical strength, prepared from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;α-Hemihydrate is a high-strength cementitious material with superior workability and mechanical strength, prepared from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;α-Hemihydrate is a high-strength cementitious material with superior workability and mechanical strength, prepared from phosphogypsum.</data>
