<node id="Chemosphere">
  <data key="d0">Chemosphere</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemosphere is a scientific journal that publishes research focused on environmental remediation, waste management, and advanced chemical processes. Among its notable publications is a 2020 study examining the use of industrial wastes to mitigate greenhouse gas emissions. The journal also features critical reviews and studies on sustainable material development, including the creation of eco-friendly geopolymers derived from solid wastes.

A substantial body of work in Chemosphere addresses phosphogypsum waste, covering its environmental impacts under redox oscillations, in-situ remediation using ground granulated blast furnace slag, fluoride retention and solidification techniques, and assessments of nanominerals and hazardous elements within the material. Furthermore, the journal disseminates research on the chemical behavior of fluorine and phosphorus during chemical looping gasification, establishing itself as a comprehensive resource for environmental chemistry and waste valorization studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemosphere is a journal that published studies on the environmental effects of redox oscillations on phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemosphere is a scientific journal that published a 2020 study on using industrial wastes to mitigate greenhouse gas emissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemosphere is a scientific journal that published research on Corynebacterium Pollutisoli SPH6 in waste activated sludge fermentation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791141872</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hydrometallurgy">
  <data key="d0">Hydrometallurgy</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydrometallurgy refers to two distinct but closely related concepts in materials science and academic publishing: a foundational metallurgical extraction process and a peer-reviewed scientific journal.

As a metallurgical process, Hydrometallurgy is a chemical extraction technique that utilizes aqueous chemistry to dissolve, separate, and purify metals from complex ore materials. It serves as a fundamental approach in extractive metallurgy, particularly for processing mineral concentrates containing rare earth elements and lanthanides. The method is frequently combined with gravity separation to achieve comprehensive rare earth element recovery. Notably, it has been specifically applied to extract valuable metals from industrial byproducts, such as phosphogypsum waste, utilizing techniques like acid leaching.

As a scientific publication, Hydrometallurgy is a peer-reviewed journal dedicated to research on metal extraction from aqueous solutions and related hydrometallurgical processes. The journal regularly publishes investigations into rare earth element recovery, acid leaching methodologies, resin-in-leach processes, lanthanide extraction, and rare earth recovery via fractional precipitation. Key featured studies include a 2021 publication detailing the recovery of rare earth elements from phosphogypsum waste and a 2019 analysis of the resin-in-leach process. Together, these dual roles highlight Hydrometallurgy's significance in both industrial metal processing and academic research dissemination.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013</data>
