<node id="J. Clean. Prod.">
  <data key="d0">J. Clean. Prod.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">J. Clean. Prod. is a peer-reviewed scientific and academic journal dedicated to publishing research and reviews on clean production, environmental technologies, and sustainable industrial practices. Serving as a comprehensive platform for advancing circular economy solutions, the publication regularly features studies that address innovative methods for managing waste streams, converting them into valuable resources, and supporting sustainable manufacturing and environmental remediation.

A significant portion of the journal’s content centers on the valorization, stabilization, and utilization of phosphogypsum. It has published extensive research on recycling phosphogypsum, including techniques for the efficient precipitation of soluble phosphorus impurities during the recycling process, as well as the co-preparation of cement and sulfuric acid. The journal also documents the immobilization and application of phosphogypsum in various construction and industrial contexts, such as synthesizing cleaner gypsum for road construction, evaluating its potential in cemented paste backfill, and incorporating it into cement composites. Additionally, it addresses the environmental risks and analysis associated with phosphogypsum utilization.

Beyond phosphogypsum, the journal covers research on the environmental impacts of rare earth production, notably featuring a 2018 study detailing techniques for extracting rare earth elements from phosphogypsum. Its scope also extends to other industrial by-products and sustainable material innovations, including studies on the modification of granulated copper slag, the recycling of construction and demolition waste, the use of biochar additives, carbon dioxide curing in cement composites, and carbon dioxide mineral sequestration for calcium carbonate production. Through these diverse contributions, J. Clean. Prod. continues to support scientific inquiry into resource recovery and sustainable industrial development.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Clean. Prod. is a scientific journal that published reviews on the valorisation of industrial residues.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Clean. Prod. is a scientific journal that published studies on the synthesis of gypsum from cleaner phosphogypsum and its valorization as road material.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Clean. Prod. is a scientific journal that published research on phosphogypsum waste management and rare earth production impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Clean. Prod. is a scientific journal publishing research on clean production and environmental applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-017</data>
