<node id="Cemented Paste Backfill">
  <data key="d0">Cemented Paste Backfill</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Cemented Paste Backfill is a specialized construction mixture and mining technique primarily designed for in-situ waste management, remediation, and underground structural support. It functions as a cost-effective and scalable approach that balances technical feasibility with economic rationality, making it highly suitable for large-scale industrial applications. The mixture is fundamentally utilized to immobilize and store phosphogypsum, a byproduct of phosphate fertilizer production, while simultaneously managing mine tailings and filling mined voids.

The engineering and mechanical characteristics of Cemented Paste Backfill, including compressive strength and workability, are directly influenced by the inclusion of phosphogypsum. To optimize these properties alongside the material's retention capacity for potentially toxic elements, phosphorus, and fluorine, binders and specialized additives are systematically incorporated into the mixture. This formulation ensures that the backfill not only provides robust structural integrity but also effectively sequesters hazardous and valuable chemical components within the stabilized matrix.

By integrating waste materials into a cohesive construction medium, Cemented Paste Backfill advances sustainable resource management and environmental remediation practices. It serves a dual purpose in the mining and construction sectors by stabilizing hazardous waste, preventing environmental contamination, and delivering reliable underground support. Consequently, this technique represents a comprehensive solution that merges waste valorization with practical geotechnical engineering requirements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-015</data>
