  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Rare and precious heavy metals are valuable components found in PG, with increasing market demand driving their extraction from solid wastes.&lt;SEP&gt;Rare and precious heavy metals are valuable components found in PG, with increasing market demand driving their extraction from solid wastes.&lt;SEP&gt;Rare and precious heavy metals are valuable components found in PG, with increasing market demand driving their extraction from solid wastes.</data>
