  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbonate and bicarbonate salts are preferred precipitation agents used under ambient conditions to form REE carbonates or hydroxy carbonates.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbonate and bicarbonate salts are preferred precipitation agents used under ambient conditions to form REE carbonates or hydroxy carbonates.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbonate and bicarbonate salts are preferred precipitation agents used under ambient conditions to form REE carbonates or hydroxy carbonates.</data>
