<node id="Supersulfated Cement">
  <data key="d0">Supersulfated Cement</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Supersulfated cement is a construction material whose hydration properties are affected by calcination-modified phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Supersulfated cement is a construction material whose hydration properties are affected by calcination-modified phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A cement type whose hydration properties are affected by modified phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Supersulfated cement is a specialized cement type whose hydration properties are affected by modified phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Supersulfated cement is a specific type of cement listed as an application for phosphogypsum in the cement industry.&lt;SEP&gt;Supersulfated cement is a construction material whose hydration properties are modified by phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Supersulfated cement is a construction material whose hydration properties are affected by calcination-modified phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-019</data>
