<node id="Syngas">
  <data key="d0">Syngas</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Syngas is a gaseous fuel and synthesis gas mixture primarily composed of carbon monoxide (CO) and hydrogen (H2). It serves as the target product generated through the chemical looping gasification (CLG) of low-rank or low-order lignite. In this specialized gasification process, phosphogypsum functions as the oxygen carrier to facilitate the reaction and drive the production of the desired gaseous output.

The resulting syngas is highly valued in CLG applications due to its high selectivity and efficiency. By utilizing phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier during the lignite chemical looping gasification process, the system optimally yields this CO and H2-rich mixture, establishing syngas as a key energy carrier derived from low-grade coal resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Syngas is a gaseous fuel produced through the chemical looping gasification of lignite using phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier.&lt;SEP&gt;Syngas is generated through the lignite chemical looping gasification process utilizing phosphogypsum as an oxygen carrier.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-024</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791119265</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lignite">
  <data key="d0">Lignite</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Lignite is a low-rank, low-grade fossil fuel classified as a type of coal that serves as a carbon-containing feedstock and primary reactant in advanced energy conversion technologies. It is extensively utilized in the chemical looping gasification process, where it functions as a fuel source to produce syngas and facilitate the development of clean energy. The gasification process involving lignite is notably enhanced by the integration of phosphogypsum, specifically through the use of phosphogypsum-based and multimetal phosphogypsum-based oxygen carriers. In this coupled system, lignite acts as the starting material that reacts with phosphogypsum, where adjusting the lignite ratio directly influences the resulting product phases.

Beyond its industrial applications, lignite is actively studied for its specific fluidization characteristics and reaction behavior within chemical looping environments. Researchers examine how these properties affect overall process efficiency, making lignite a critical component in optimizing gasification techniques and sustainable fuel processing. Its role as a versatile reactant in phosphogypsum-coupled systems highlights its importance in modern chemical looping research aimed at improving energy yield and environmental sustainability.&lt;SEP&gt;Lignite is a coal type used as a feedstock in the chemical looping gasification process to produce syngas.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-010</data>
