  <data key="d2">Dissolution of rare earth elements is the process where solid phosphogypsum is digested by a leaching agent to extract valuable components.&lt;SEP&gt;Dissolution of rare earth elements is the process where solid phosphogypsum is digested by a leaching agent to extract valuable components.&lt;SEP&gt;Dissolution of rare earth elements is the process where solid phosphogypsum is digested by a leaching agent to extract valuable components.</data>
