  <data key="d0">Carbon Monoxide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbon Monoxide is a gaseous product produced during the gasification of lignite.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon Monoxide is a gaseous product produced during the gasification of lignite.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon monoxide is a primary product formed from the conversion of lignite promoted by released oxygen.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon monoxide is a gaseous component measured in the H2/CO ratio and featured as a key element in the ternary phase diagram.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon Monoxide is a gaseous product produced during the gasification of lignite.</data>
