<node id="Journal of Cleaner Production">
  <data key="d0">Journal of Cleaner Production</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Journal of Cleaner Production is a peer-reviewed scientific journal dedicated to advancing research on sustainable production and environmental technologies. It serves as a key publication platform for academic and industrial studies aimed at reducing environmental impacts and promoting resource efficiency.

The journal has published extensive research on the applications and utilization of phosphogypsum, particularly its integration into construction and cementitious materials, as well as its deployment in sorption processes. Furthermore, it frequently features studies on resource recovery, including rare earth recycling and the leaching of rare earth elements from phosphogypsum. The publication also supports comprehensive environmental evaluations by disseminating life cycle assessments that analyze the sustainability and ecological footprint of these industrial materials and recovery methods.&lt;SEP&gt;An academic journal that published research on the utilization of original phosphogypsum as raw material.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Cleaner Production is a journal that published multiple studies on phosphogypsum applications and rare earth recycling.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Cleaner Production is a scientific journal that published multiple studies on phosphogypsum and construction materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Cleaner Production publishes studies on the utilization of phosphogypsum in cementitious materials and sorption processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-021</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
