</node>
<node id="Minerals">
  <data key="d0">Minerals</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Minerals is a scientific, open-access journal dedicated to publishing research across the fields of mineralogy, petrology, and economic geology, with a broader focus on mineral applications. The publication features a diverse range of studies, including investigations into rare earth carbonates and gypsum precipitation pathways. It also covers industrial and practical applications of mineral by-products, such as research on goaf filling using hemihydrate phosphogypsum and the utilization of water-washing pre-treated phosphogypsum for backfill applications.

In addition to these industrial and geological studies, Minerals publishes work on specific mineral processing and extraction techniques, including collophanite flotation. By encompassing both theoretical research and applied industrial experiments, the journal serves as a comprehensive resource for advancements in the geological, mining, and materials sectors.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-021</data>
