</node>
<node id="Calcium Phosphate">
  <data key="d0">Calcium Phosphate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Calcium phosphate is an insoluble solid-phase chemical compound, chemically represented as Ca3(PO4)2, that forms through the interaction of calcium and phosphate ions. In industrial and materials research contexts, it is consistently identified alongside phosphogypsum (PG), where it manifests as a specific precipitate originating from PG impurities. This compound is frequently mixed with phosphogypsum in various forms and is hypothesized to be precipitated directly onto the surface of phosphogypsum crystals. Analytical studies generally attribute its presence in processed samples to precipitation mechanisms, confirming its status as an insoluble solid-phase material.

Beyond its formation characteristics, calcium phosphate exhibits several functional properties that are significant in material applications. It is capable of forming protective coatings and is notably associated with the considerable retardation of cement setting times. Furthermore, within the specialized context of oxygen carrier systems, calcium phosphate functions as an adhesive agent that binds oxygen carrier particles together. Collectively, these descriptions characterize calcium phosphate as a phosphogypsum-derived precipitate with distinct chemical, structural, and functional roles in cementitious and particulate material systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium phosphate is a chemical compound mixed with phosphogypsum in various forms.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium phosphate is a specific precipitate formed from PG impurities.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium phosphate is a precipitate formed when calcium carbonate reacts with orthophosphate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-022</data>
