  <data key="d0">Resource Utilization Mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Resource utilization mechanism encompasses the processes of dissolution, decomposition, and crystallization for PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource utilization mechanism encompasses the processes of dissolution, decomposition, and crystallization for PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource utilization mechanism encompasses the processes of dissolution, decomposition, and crystallization for PG.</data>
