<node id="Sodium Hydroxide">
  <data key="d0">Sodium Hydroxide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sodium Hydroxide is a strong alkaline base and mineral compound utilized across a diverse range of industrial, materials, and analytical applications. In environmental and resource recovery contexts, it serves as a critical reagent for treating phosphogypsum. Recovered through electrodialysis for reuse, Sodium Hydroxide dissolves and chemically treats phosphogypsum, a process that generates calcium hydroxide while simultaneously enriching the material with rare earth elements. This alkaline treatment is frequently employed as a preparatory step preceding citric acid leaching, where Sodium Hydroxide acts as a primary reactant to facilitate the efficient extraction and recovery of rare earth elements.

Beyond resource recovery, Sodium Hydroxide plays a vital role in advanced materials synthesis. It functions as an alkaline activator in geopolymer production, where it effectively promotes early hydration reactions to enhance material formation and structural development. In analytical chemistry, its strong alkaline properties are leveraged to create precise reaction environments. It is utilized as an alkaline medium to ensure the complete decomposition of hydrogen ions during nitrogen analysis. Additionally, Sodium Hydroxide is incorporated into sodium tetraphenylboron solutions to enable accurate potassium measurement. Through these varied applications, Sodium Hydroxide demonstrates its versatility as a fundamental chemical reagent in waste valorization, metallurgy, construction materials, and quantitative analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium hydroxide is a raw material consumed in the PBG technology process.&lt;SEP&gt;A raw material consumed by the PBG process.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium hydroxide is a chemical input used in the PBG scenario.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-016</data>
