  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Metal trace elements are trace impurities in phosphogypsum that exist through lattice doping, atom replacement, surface adsorption, and interstitial filling.&lt;SEP&gt;Metal trace elements are trace impurities in phosphogypsum that exist through lattice doping, atom replacement, surface adsorption, and interstitial filling.&lt;SEP&gt;Metal trace elements are trace impurities in phosphogypsum that exist through lattice doping, atom replacement, surface adsorption, and interstitial filling.</data>
