  <data key="d2">Agglomeration is a physical phenomenon in phosphogypsum caused by its moisture content, leading to fine particle clumping.&lt;SEP&gt;Agglomeration is a physical phenomenon in phosphogypsum caused by its moisture content, leading to fine particle clumping.&lt;SEP&gt;Agglomeration is a physical phenomenon in phosphogypsum caused by its moisture content, leading to fine particle clumping.</data>
