<node id="Lanthanides">
  <data key="d0">Lanthanides</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Lanthanides are valuable rare-earth elements recovered from phosphate rock sources.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanthanides are valuable rare-earth elements recovered from phosphate rock sources.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanthanides are a subset of rare earth elements specifically targeted for leaching and recovery from phosphogypsum fertilizers.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanthanides are a group of elements extracted from phosphoric acid production processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanthanides are a group of rare earth elements targeted for leaching from phosphohemihydrate using nitric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanthanides are a group of rare earth elements targeted for recovery from phosphate rock.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanthanides are valuable rare-earth elements recovered from phosphate rock sources.</data>
