</node>
<node id="Phosphogypsum Waste">
  <data key="d0">Phosphogypsum Waste</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphogypsum Waste is an industrial byproduct and solid waste material generated during the wet processing of phosphate rock for the production of phosphoric acid and fertilizers. It is characterized by a distinct mineralogical and elemental composition, alongside notably high concentrations of radionuclides. Consequently, the material is frequently analyzed for its radioactive decay properties and overall radiological profile.

Due to its substantial volume and chemical makeup, Phosphogypsum Waste has become a focal point in numerous studies dedicated to its environmental management, recycling, and broader material applications. Researchers are actively investigating its potential as a secondary source for recovering valuable rare earth elements. Furthermore, the material is being explored for specialized industrial conversions, such as the synthesis of nano-calcium fluoride, highlighting its growing relevance in sustainable resource recovery and advanced material science.&lt;SEP&gt;Waste material generated from phosphate fertilizer production, containing Rare Earth Elements as impurities.&lt;SEP&gt;Accumulated phosphogypsum waste forming the mounds.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum waste is a byproduct referenced across multiple studies for its management, recycling, and material applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-023</data>
