  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Resin-in-leach process is a recovery technique involving the selection of resins, leaching agents, and eluents to extract rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Resin-in-leach process is a recovery technique involving the selection of resins, leaching agents, and eluents to extract rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Resin-in-leach process is a recovery technique involving the selection of resins, leaching agents, and eluents to extract rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.</data>
