  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The flotation method is a traditional technique used to remove suspended organic matter from phosphogypsum slurry.&lt;SEP&gt;The flotation method is a traditional technique used to remove suspended organic matter from phosphogypsum slurry but fails to thoroughly remove phosphorus and fluorine.&lt;SEP&gt;The flotation method is a traditional technique used to remove suspended organic matter from phosphogypsum slurry but fails to thoroughly remove phosphorus and fluorine.&lt;SEP&gt;The flotation method is a traditional technique used to remove suspended organic matter from phosphogypsum slurry.&lt;SEP&gt;The flotation method is a traditional technique used to remove suspended organic matter from phosphogypsum slurry but fails to thoroughly remove phosphorus and fluorine.&lt;SEP&gt;The flotation method is a traditional technique used to remove suspended organic matter from phosphogypsum slurry.</data>
