  <data key="d0">Precipitation Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The precipitation method reduces soluble phosphorus and fluorine influence in phosphogypsum but cannot prevent long-term dissolution.&lt;SEP&gt;The precipitation method reduces soluble phosphorus and fluorine influence in phosphogypsum but cannot prevent long-term dissolution.&lt;SEP&gt;The precipitation method reduces soluble phosphorus and fluorine influence in phosphogypsum but cannot prevent long-term dissolution.</data>
