  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Soluble phosphorus is a harmful impurity in phosphogypsum that contributes to secondary pollution and requires removal through pretreatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Soluble phosphorus is a harmful impurity in phosphogypsum that contributes to secondary pollution and requires removal through pretreatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Soluble phosphorus is a harmful impurity in phosphogypsum that contributes to secondary pollution and requires removal through pretreatment.</data>
