  <data key="d2">Calcium Sulfoaluminate Cement is a construction material synthesized using phosphogypsum as a sole calcium oxide source.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium Sulfoaluminate Cement is a construction material synthesized using phosphogypsum as a sole calcium oxide source.&lt;SEP&gt;A specialized cement type whose performance is influenced by phosphorus impurities found in materials like phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium sulfoaluminate cement is a construction material that can utilize phosphogypsum as a sole calcium oxide source.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium Sulfoaluminate Cement is a construction material synthesized using phosphogypsum as a sole calcium oxide source.</data>
