<node id="Organic Matter">
  <data key="d0">Organic Matter</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Organic matter is a complex chemical component and impurity primarily associated with phosphogypsum, a byproduct of phosphate processing. Within phosphogypsum slurry, it exists as suspended material composed of aliphatic compounds, carbonic acids, amines, and ketones. It is formally classified as an impurity type within the material's chemical composition and is routinely quantified as a percentage during sample analysis. To purify phosphogypsum, organic matter is targeted for removal or reduction through several industrial methods, including flotation of the slurry, washing, and chemical treatment with citric acid.

Beyond its industrial context, organic matter also functions as a soil component that accumulates in areas surrounding phosphogypsum storage or disposal sites. This environmental accumulation negatively impacts local ecosystems by diminishing the soil's capacity to retain and supply essential nutrients. Together, these characteristics define organic matter as both a measurable chemical impurity requiring industrial management and an environmental factor influencing soil health near phosphogypsum operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Organic matter is suspended material in phosphogypsum slurry that can be removed by flotation.&lt;SEP&gt;Substance decomposed during microbial fermentation that provides nutrients for microbial growth.&lt;SEP&gt;Organic matter is frequently associated with enriched trace elements in phosphorites through complexation or adsorption.&lt;SEP&gt;An organic component constituting approximately 2% of phosphorite composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Organic matter is an impurity present in phosphogypsum solids.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-001</data>
