  <data key="d0">SEM-EDS</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">SEM-EDS is an analytical characterization technique used to study phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;SEM-EDS is an analytical characterization technique used to study phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;SEM-EDS is a characterization method used for mineralogical analysis of coal waste.&lt;SEP&gt;SEM-EDS is a mineralogical characterization technique used to analyze coal waste for rare earth elements.&lt;SEP&gt;SEM-EDS is an analytical characterization technique used to study phosphogypsum.</data>
