  <data key="d0">Sulfur Trioxide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sulfur trioxide is a chemical compound present in phosphogypsum composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfur trioxide is a chemical compound present in phosphogypsum composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfur trioxide is a chemical compound present in phosphogypsum composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfur trioxide is an intermediate compound formed during sulfur dioxide conversion in sulfuric acid preparation.</data>
