<node id="Calcium Oxide">
  <data key="d0">Calcium Oxide</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Calcium oxide is a chemical compound that occurs within the composition of phosphogypsum and serves as a primary target for resource utilization. It is derived from calcium found in phosphogypsum, though it can also be synthesized from calcium sulfate or calcium sulfide. Production employs various specialized techniques, including low-temperature or reduced-temperature decomposition processes, as well as reduction and decomposition methods. Additionally, high-purity calcium oxide can be obtained by oxidizing calcium sulfide in air at approximately 1000°C, and in certain processing routes, it is prepared alongside calcium carbonate.

Depending on the synthesis pathway and processing conditions, the resulting material is characterized as a high-quality, high-purity compound. It serves multiple industrial functions, notably acting as a neutralizing agent to treat precipitation mother liquid during phosphate ore processing. Furthermore, calcium oxide is utilized in the construction industry as a key component for cement clinker. Through these diverse production methods and applications, calcium oxide effectively transforms industrial byproducts into valuable chemical and construction materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium oxide is a chemical compound present in phosphogypsum composition.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium oxide is a product formed alongside sulfur dioxide and carbon dioxide during the reaction of calcium sulfate and coke.&lt;SEP&gt;A product of the chemical reaction, also known as Quicklime, represented as $2\text{CaO}$.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791209031</data>
