  <data key="d0">Bicarbonate Form</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The Bicarbonate Form (CdHCO3+) is a chemical species of cadmium present in lower concentrations than the hydroxo complex.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bicarbonate Form (CdHCO3+) is a chemical species of cadmium present in lower concentrations than the hydroxo complex.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-010</data>
