<node id="CCE System">
  <data key="d0">CCE System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The CCE System refers to the current state of equilibrium that governs ion binding, adsorption, and salt transfer in the soil.&lt;SEP&gt;The CCE System refers to the current state of equilibrium that governs ion binding, adsorption, and salt transfer in the soil.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-010</data>
