</node>
<node id="Soil Profile">
  <data key="d0">Soil Profile</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Soil Profile is the vertical section of soil through which carbonate forms and salts migrate and accumulate.&lt;SEP&gt;The Soil Profile is the vertical section of soil through which carbonate forms and salts migrate and accumulate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1790951494</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Soil Solution">
  <data key="d0">Soil Solution</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil Solution is the aqueous and liquid phase within the soil matrix and micro-basins, serving as the primary medium for dissolved ions, compounds, and microelements. It contains a diverse array of chemical species, including macro-ions, hydroxyl ions, and active cadmium ions, with cadmium concentrations typically remaining significantly lower than those of macro-ions. This liquid phase is fundamentally governed by chemical equilibria, such as the calcium-carbonate equilibrium, and facilitates ion associations, chemical migration phenomena, and continuous interactions with surrounding soil properties. Within this medium, heavy metals and cadmium exist in various chemical forms, exhibit mobility, and directly influence their bioavailability.

Functionally, Soil Solution acts as the critical transport mechanism that delivers essential ions and nutrients directly to plant roots. Because of its complex chemical dynamics, it serves as the essential environment for thermodynamic modeling, particularly regarding cadmium status, and functions as the standard medium for measuring ion activities, heavy metal bioavailability, and macro-ion or hydroxyl ion dynamics. Ultimately, Soil Solution plays a central role in governing soil chemistry, nutrient cycling, and the migration of dissolved substances throughout the terrestrial ecosystem.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-000</data>
