  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Salts are chemical compounds that migrate and accumulate throughout the soil profile and transfer laterally between soil components.&lt;SEP&gt;Salts are chemical compounds that migrate and accumulate throughout the soil profile and transfer laterally between soil components.</data>
