<node id="ION-3">
  <data key="d0">ION-3</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">ION-3 is a mathematical chemical-thermodynamic program and computational model designed to analyze the thermodynamic properties of soil solutions. Grounded in electrolyte theory, the software implements the CCE thermodynamic mathematical model and its associated algorithm. It functions as a specialized computational tool for determining ion activity, equilibrium concentrations, and macro-ion stability constants within soil environments.

In addition to fundamental equilibrium calculations, ION-3 is utilized to model ion association processes, predict shifts in soil pH, and evaluate heavy metal passivation. The program is also specifically applied to identify and calculate the various chemical forms of heavy metals present in soil solutions. By integrating these thermodynamic and computational capabilities, ION-3 provides a comprehensive framework for understanding complex soil solution chemistry and metal behavior.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-000</data>
