<node id="Intra-soil Mechanical Processing">
  <data key="d0">Intra-soil Mechanical Processing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intra-soil mechanical processing is a technique that crushes soil horizons and mixes amendments or waste into the soil mass.&lt;SEP&gt;A technique for processing soil and applying matter simultaneously, studied in long-term field experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Intra-soil mechanical processing is a technique that crushes soil horizons and mixes amendments or waste into the soil mass.&lt;SEP&gt;A technique for processing soil and applying matter simultaneously, studied in long-term field experiments.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-008</data>
