<node id="Soil Amendment">
  <data key="d0">Soil Amendment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil amendment is a material applied to the soil to improve its properties and is mixed during intra-soil processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil amendment is a material applied to the soil to improve its properties and is mixed during intra-soil processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil amendment is an agricultural application of phosphogypsum to improve nutrient levels and physical and chemical properties of various soil types.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil Amendment is a PG management method compared by Tsioka and Voudrias for environmental impacts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-001</data>
