  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Waste is a material applied to the soil alongside amendments and is dispersed during intra-soil processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Waste is a material applied to the soil alongside amendments and is dispersed during intra-soil processing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007</data>
