  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Long-term field experiments are extended studies that applied and analyzed intra-soil processing techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Extended experimental trials where intra-soil processing was applied and studied.&lt;SEP&gt;Long-term field experiments are extended studies that applied and analyzed intra-soil processing techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Extended experimental trials where intra-soil processing was applied and studied.</data>
