<node id="Batukaev">
  <data key="d0">Batukaev</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Batukaev is a researcher recognized for foundational contributions to the thermodynamic characterization of microelements. His scholarly work includes co-authoring publications that detail the CCE thermodynamic mathematical model, which directly supports his investigations into carbonate chemical equilibrium and the geochemical behavior of carbonates within the vadose zone.

In addition to his thermodynamic and geochemical research, Batukaev has assessed complex environmental interactions, specifically focusing on rhizosphere plant nutrition processes and micro-basin dynamics. His interdisciplinary approach bridges chemical modeling with ecological and hydrological systems, establishing a comprehensive framework for understanding soil-water-plant relationships.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
