  <data key="d0">Endovitsky</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A researcher cited for providing empirical data that supports the ion association coefficient concept.&lt;SEP&gt;Endovitsky is a researcher who co-authored former publications detailing the CCE thermodynamic mathematical model.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher cited for the thermodynamic mathematical model ION-3.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher cited for providing empirical data that supports the ion association coefficient concept.&lt;SEP&gt;Endovitsky is a researcher who co-authored former publications detailing the CCE thermodynamic mathematical model.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher cited for the thermodynamic mathematical model ION-3.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-009</data>
