  <data key="d2">Minkina is a researcher who co-authored former publications detailing the CCE thermodynamic mathematical model.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher cited for the typical cadmium water-soluble forms content in Haplic Chernozem.&lt;SEP&gt;Minkina is a researcher who co-authored former publications detailing the CCE thermodynamic mathematical model.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher cited for the typical cadmium water-soluble forms content in Haplic Chernozem.</data>
