<node id="Equation 4">
  <data key="d0">Equation 4</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation 4 is a mathematical equation excluded from the macro-ion system due to cadmium's minimal impact on ionic strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation 4 is a mathematical equation excluded from the macro-ion system due to cadmium's minimal impact on ionic strength.</data>
