<node id="Macro-ions">
  <data key="d0">Macro-ions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Macro-ions are ions in soil solution whose equation system excludes Equation 4 due to trace element considerations.&lt;SEP&gt;Ions present in the water extract from soil, whose analytical content and equilibrium concentrations were analyzed.&lt;SEP&gt;Macro-ions are chemical species whose activity and concentration are analyzed in soil solution after phosphogypsum application.&lt;SEP&gt;Macro-ions are ions in soil solution whose equation system excludes Equation 4 due to trace element considerations.&lt;SEP&gt;Ions present in the water extract from soil, whose analytical content and equilibrium concentrations were analyzed.&lt;SEP&gt;Macro-ions are chemical species whose activity and concentration are analyzed in soil solution after phosphogypsum application.</data>
