<node id="Soil Aggregate System">
  <data key="d0">Soil Aggregate System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The soil aggregate system is a structural framework in the soil that stabilizes biogeochemical barriers and supports microbial life.&lt;SEP&gt;A structural component of the soil that is improved by the technology to ensure high-level structuring and multilevel architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;The soil aggregate system is a structural framework in the soil that stabilizes biogeochemical barriers and supports microbial life.&lt;SEP&gt;A structural component of the soil that is improved by the technology to ensure high-level structuring and multilevel architecture.</data>
