<node id="Soil Organic Matter">
  <data key="d0">Soil Organic Matter</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil organic matter is a natural component that originates and functions within the synthesized multilevel heterogeneous soil architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil organic matter is a natural component that originates and functions within the synthesized multilevel heterogeneous soil architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil component that, when enriched in this context, reduces the soil's fertilizer retention and supply capacity.</data>
