  <data key="d2">A computational approach used to calculate soil solution macro-ion equilibrium forms and stability constants.&lt;SEP&gt;A model developed to describe the Kastanozem complex and establish principles for sustainable semiarid silviculture management.&lt;SEP&gt;A computational approach used to calculate soil solution macro-ion equilibrium forms and stability constants.&lt;SEP&gt;A model developed to describe the Kastanozem complex and establish principles for sustainable semiarid silviculture management.</data>
