<node id="Ionic Strength">
  <data key="d0">Ionic Strength</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ionic strength is a solution property that determines the transformation of ions into ion associates.&lt;SEP&gt;A measure of the soil solution's ionic environment that significantly influences the thermodynamic process of macro-ion association.&lt;SEP&gt;Ionic strength reflects the concentration of ions in soil solution, affecting ion association and complexation.&lt;SEP&gt;Ionic strength is a solution property that determines the transformation of ions into ion associates.&lt;SEP&gt;A measure of the soil solution's ionic environment that significantly influences the thermodynamic process of macro-ion association.&lt;SEP&gt;Ionic strength reflects the concentration of ions in soil solution, affecting ion association and complexation.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical condition within phosphogypsum stacks that influences the dominant chemical species present.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-034</data>
