  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The liquid component from soil samples used to analyze macro-ion content and cadmium forms.&lt;SEP&gt;A sample medium used to analyze macro-ion content and chemical parameters in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;The liquid component from soil samples used to analyze macro-ion content and cadmium forms.&lt;SEP&gt;Water Extract is the sample medium analyzed in Table 1 to determine macro-ion content and pH levels.</data>
