  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A mathematical equation that was excluded from the model due to the negligible impact of cadmium on ionic strength.&lt;SEP&gt;An equation used to substitute the total concentration value of Cd^2+ in the water extract.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical equation that was excluded from the model due to the negligible impact of cadmium on ionic strength.&lt;SEP&gt;An equation used to substitute the total concentration value of Cd^2+ in the water extract.</data>
