<node id="Vadose Zone">
  <data key="d0">Vadose Zone</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The unsaturated soil layer above the groundwater table that acts as a sink for carbonates.&lt;SEP&gt;The subsurface zone between the soil surface and groundwater, from which cadmium migration is reduced.&lt;SEP&gt;The unsaturated soil layer above the groundwater table that acts as a sink for carbonates.&lt;SEP&gt;The subsurface zone between the soil surface and groundwater, from which cadmium migration is reduced.</data>
