<node id="Fig. 7">
  <data key="d0">Fig. 7</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A figure showing the percentage of active cadmium in soil solution relative to total cadmium.&lt;SEP&gt;A figure showing the percentage of active cadmium in soil solution relative to total cadmium.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 7 displays the dynamic concentrations of Cerium and Calcium during leaching, revealing calcium concentration peaks.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 7 illustrates the concentration variation of calcium and cerium during the leaching of phosphogypsum with hydrochloric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 7 plots compressive and bending strength values as a function of NaCl content.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 7 is a figure illustrating the Boren-Haber reaction cycle in the catalytic decomposition of PG.</data>
