  <data key="d2">Trophic chains are biological pathways negatively impacted by cadmium contamination.&lt;SEP&gt;Trophic chains represent the ecological pathway through which heavy metals like cadmium can penetrate from plants into the broader ecosystem.&lt;SEP&gt;Trophic chains are biological pathways negatively impacted by cadmium contamination.&lt;SEP&gt;Trophic chains represent the ecological pathway through which heavy metals like cadmium can penetrate from plants into the broader ecosystem.</data>
