  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">CCE is a system used to calculate Calcium Carbonate solubility and is linked to liquid phases.&lt;SEP&gt;CCE determines the proportion of molar fractions of free and associated ions in soil solution and influences thermodynamic equilibrium.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical or physical factor discussed alongside ion association that contributes to heavy metal passivation in soil solution.&lt;SEP&gt;CCE is a system used to calculate Calcium Carbonate solubility and is linked to liquid phases.&lt;SEP&gt;CCE determines the proportion of molar fractions of free and associated ions in soil solution and influences thermodynamic equilibrium.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical or physical factor discussed alongside ion association that contributes to heavy metal passivation in soil solution.</data>
