<node id="North Carolina">
  <data key="d0">North Carolina</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">North Carolina is a phosphate rock deposit in the USA with a cadmium concentration of 47 mg/kg.&lt;SEP&gt;North Carolina is a geographic location in the USA referenced for soil cadmium concentration data.&lt;SEP&gt;North Carolina is a geographic location in the USA referenced for soil cadmium concentration data.&lt;SEP&gt;North Carolina is a phosphate rock deposit in the USA with a cadmium concentration of 47 mg/kg.</data>
