  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">No-till soil management system is a framework where phosphogypsum is applied to the soil surface without mixing.&lt;SEP&gt;No-till soil management system is a framework where phosphogypsum is applied to the soil surface without mixing.</data>
