<node id="Soil solution">
  <data key="d0">Soil solution</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil solution is the liquid phase in soil where chemical equilibria and ion associations occur.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil solution is the liquid phase in soil where chemical equilibria and ion associations occur.</data>
