  <data key="d0">Plant root system</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Plant root system is the biological structure that absorbs nutrients and contaminants like cadmium from the soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Plant root system is the biological structure that absorbs nutrients and contaminants like cadmium from the soil.</data>
