  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil amelioration is an agricultural practice that utilizes phosphogypsum to improve soil properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil amelioration is an agricultural practice that utilizes phosphogypsum to improve soil properties.</data>
