  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil remediation is an environmental process aimed at minimizing pollutant toxicity and mobility in soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil remediation is an environmental process aimed at minimizing pollutant toxicity and mobility in soil.</data>
