  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Amelioration substances are applied to processed soil layers to remediate hazards and improve soil structure.&lt;SEP&gt;Amelioration substances are applied to processed soil layers to remediate hazards and improve soil structure.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-013</data>
