  <data key="d0">Soil Carcass Architecture</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil carcass architecture refers to the multilevel structural organization of soil that facilitates root access and nutrient flux.&lt;SEP&gt;Soil carcass architecture refers to the multilevel structural organization of soil that facilitates root access and nutrient flux.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-013</data>
