  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The rhizosphere plant nutrition process involves interactions between root hairs, soil solution, and discrete micro-basins.&lt;SEP&gt;The rhizosphere plant nutrition process involves interactions between root hairs, soil solution, and discrete micro-basins.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-013</data>
