  <data key="d0">Micro-basin</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Micro-basins are discrete areas between soil aggregates that store soil solution and mediate substance transfer to plant roots.&lt;SEP&gt;Micro-basins are discrete areas between soil aggregates that store soil solution and mediate substance transfer to plant roots.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-013</data>
