  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphate rocks are natural deposits that determine the cadmium content in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate rocks are natural deposits that determine the cadmium content in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Raw material used for phosphoric acid production, analyzed for comparison with PG waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate Rocks are geological materials analyzed for chemical composition and used as a source for uranium recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural mineral deposits analyzed for their chemical composition, particle size, and potential radiation hazards.</data>
