  <data key="d2">Bou Craa is a phosphate rock deposit in Morocco with a cadmium concentration of 38 mg/kg.&lt;SEP&gt;Bou Craa is a phosphate rock deposit in Morocco with a cadmium concentration of 38 mg/kg.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-001</data>
