  <data key="d0">Sea of Azov</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Sea of Azov is a body of water connected to the Black Sea, visible on the satellite map.&lt;SEP&gt;A body of water into which the Don River flows.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sea of Azov is a body of water connected to the Black Sea region, receiving the Don River.</data>
