<node id="Don River">
  <data key="d0">Don River</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Don River is a river for which the terrain of the Rostov Region serves as a plains-type watershed.&lt;SEP&gt;The Don River is a major river visible on the satellite map, flowing into the Sea of Azov.&lt;SEP&gt;The Don River is a river visible flowing into the Sea of Azov near the industrial area.&lt;SEP&gt;Don River is a river for which the terrain of the Rostov Region serves as a plains-type watershed.&lt;SEP&gt;The Don River is a major river visible on the map flowing into the Sea of Azov.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-023</data>
