</node>
<node id="Milling Cutters">
  <data key="d0">Milling Cutters</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Components that provide a fine aggregate structure to initially compacted soil and feed soil into a container.&lt;SEP&gt;Components that provide a fine aggregate structure to initially compacted soil and feed soil into a container.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-014</data>
