</node>
<node id="Standard Technology">
  <data key="d0">Standard Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Standard technology refers to conventional agricultural practices like plowing that fail to ensure multilevel soil structure and fertility.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard technology refers to conventional agricultural practices like plowing that fail to ensure multilevel soil structure and fertility.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-014</data>
