<node id="Soil Porous System">
  <data key="d0">Soil Porous System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The soil porous system is a structural feature whose architecture is critical for soil stability, nutrient transfer, and plant growth.&lt;SEP&gt;The soil porous system is a structural feature whose architecture is critical for soil stability, nutrient transfer, and plant growth.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-014</data>
