  <data key="d0">SAC</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">SAC (Soil Adsorption Complex) is a soil component where chemically activated calcium adsorbs to reinforce aggregate shells.&lt;SEP&gt;SAC (Soil Adsorption Complex) is a soil component where chemically activated calcium adsorbs to reinforce aggregate shells.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-014</data>
