  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">A city in the Krasnodar Krai region of Russia depicted in the satellite map.&lt;SEP&gt;A city occupying the right side of the image, characterized by a dense grid of residential streets and housing blocks.&lt;SEP&gt;Belorechensk is a city in the Krasnodar Krai region of Russia, located near the industrial phosphogypsum facility.</data>
