<node id="Mathematical Equation">
  <data key="d0">Mathematical Equation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A formula defining the k_asCd parameter by summing interactions between Cadmium and five anions.&lt;SEP&gt;The mathematical equation calculates the adsorption coefficient for cadmium by summing terms representing ligand concentrations and inverse stability constants.&lt;SEP&gt;A formula $F_p = \frac{3f\gamma_b}{2r}$ describing forces in phosphogypsum physics.&lt;SEP&gt;The mathematical equation P = P_p - P_c represents a pressure balance calculation used in engineering contexts.</data>
