  <data key="d2">Intra-soil milling is a soil mechanical processing technique used for the dispersed application of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A technique that ensures better soil continuum structure and provides high-rate passivation of pollutants by organic and mineral soil phases.&lt;SEP&gt;Intra-soil milling is a soil mechanical processing technique used for the dispersed application of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A technique that ensures better soil continuum structure and provides high-rate passivation of pollutants by organic and mineral soil phases.</data>
