</node>
<node id="Rhizosphere Methanotrophs">
  <data key="d0">Rhizosphere Methanotrophs</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Rhizosphere Methanotrophs are microorganisms in the facultative anaerobic layer that consume methane within the rice paddy ecosystem.&lt;SEP&gt;Microorganisms that inhabit the anaerobic layer and consume methane.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-027</data>
