<node id="Groundwater">
  <data key="d0">Groundwater</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Groundwater is an underground water resource and subsurface aquifer system, encompassing shallow surficial aquifers, that functions as a critical environmental medium. It is highly susceptible to contamination from the leaching of hazardous substances associated with phosphogypsum storage, phosphogypsum stacks, and cemented paste backfill applications. This interaction exposes the aquifer system to acidic conditions, mobile anions, trace elements, and heavy metal complexes, posing a significant pollution risk to this vital environmental resource.

The geochemical dynamics of groundwater are profoundly shaped by its contact with dumped phosphogypsum, which drives the redistribution of potentially toxic elements and the formation of contaminant plumes that migrate toward the ocean. In studied regions, groundwater consistently exhibits elevated contaminant levels, alongside distinct radionuclide signatures. Specifically, radioactive decay processes cause a notable enrichment of Uranium-234 relative to Uranium-238, while Polonium-210 and occasionally elevated Radium-226 are also detected. The concentration of Radium-226 within the aqueous environment is further modulated by ionic strength and total dissolved solids, underscoring the complex interplay between hydrogeological transport and chemical leaching processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-033</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
