<node id="Chemical Instability">
  <data key="d0">Chemical Instability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemical Instability describes the tendency of calcium-aluminum-silicate phases within phosphogypsum to transform or break down.</data>
