<node id="Sulfuric acid">
  <data key="d0">Sulfuric acid</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sulfuric acid is a strong acid that reacts with thorium(IV) phosphate to drive the chemical transformation.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfuric acid is a chemical reagent used in the wet process to attack phosphate rock for phosphoric acid production.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-000</data>
