  <data key="d0">Cement clinker</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cement clinker is a processed material used to produce cement, characterized by specific chemical and phase compositions.&lt;SEP&gt;A primary component interground with phosphogypsum to produce Portland cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Cement clinker is the primary raw material used in the production of Portland cement.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-002</data>
