  <data key="d2">A cement variant produced by intergrinding granulated blastfurnace slag and cement clinker with gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Portland slag cement is a construction material manufactured using granulated blast furnace slag.&lt;SEP&gt;Portland slag cement is a variant of cement whose properties are compared alongside Portland cement.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-002</data>
