  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Citric acid is a chemical solution used to wash and purify phosphogypsum samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Citric acid is an aqueous solution used to treat phosphogypsum samples to mitigate its negative effects on cement.</data>
