  <data key="d0">MgO</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Magnesium oxide is a chemical constituent in cement clinker, granulated slag, and phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical compound listed in the concentration table with an average value of 834.86 ppm.&lt;SEP&gt;MgO is a chemical compound that functions as an alkaline activator in binder mixtures for PG remediation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-012</data>
