  <data key="d2">Purified water used as the solvent for solubility determination and washing.&lt;SEP&gt;Distilled Water is a purified water used to wash the residual solid phase and remove undesirable phases.&lt;SEP&gt;Distilled water is used to wash the BS material to obtain the washed solid.&lt;SEP&gt;Distilled water is used to wash beneficiated solids and remove water-soluble compounds like nardite.</data>
