<node id="Phosphate Ion">
  <data key="d0">Phosphate Ion</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphate Ion is a chemical product formed during the hydrolysis of pyrophosphate ions.&lt;SEP&gt;A negatively charged ion represented as two orthophosphate ions in the reaction products.&lt;SEP&gt;An ion (PO4 3-) that reacts with calcium ions to form insoluble calcium phosphate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-007</data>
