<node id="Reaction Equation">
  <data key="d0">Reaction Equation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The chemical equation that describes the hydrolysis of the pyrophosphate ion.&lt;SEP&gt;Reaction Equation is the chemical representation (Eq. 3) describing the breakdown of the CaSO4·2H2O lattice to release ions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-005</data>
