<node id="Mineral Selenite Gypsum">
  <data key="d0">Mineral Selenite Gypsum</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Mineral selenite gypsum is a mineral gypsum variant assessed for its properties in Portland slag cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Mineral Selenite Gypsum is a natural gypsum material used as a standard or alternative to purified phosphogypsum in cement manufacturing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-006</data>
