  <data key="d2">M. Singh is an author who published research on the utilization of phosphogypsum for building materials in 1988.&lt;SEP&gt;M. Singh is a researcher who investigated the beneficiation and processing of phosphogypsum for building materials and plaster.&lt;SEP&gt;M. Singh is a researcher who co-authored multiple studies on phosphogypsum purification and cement manufacture.&lt;SEP&gt;M. Singh is a researcher who developed improved processes for purifying phosphogypsum and treating it for cement and plaster manufacture.&lt;SEP&gt;Researcher who investigated treating waste phosphogypsum for use in cement and plaster manufacture.</data>
