<node id="India">
  <data key="d0">India</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">India is the country where the Central Building Research Institute is located and where significant amounts of phosphogypsum are produced.&lt;SEP&gt;India is a country where the Central Building Research Institute is located and where Indian Standards apply.&lt;SEP&gt;India is a country where the chemical compositions of PG have been analyzed and tabulated.&lt;SEP&gt;India is a country listed on the vertical axis of the chart, with the longest bar indicating a weight percentage of approximately 47%.&lt;SEP&gt;India is the geographic location where phosphogypsum was used for the reclamation of sodic soils.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-041</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791189571</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Citric Acid">
  <data key="d0">Citric Acid</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Citric acid is a chemical used in aqueous solution to purify phosphogypsum by converting impurities into water-removable compounds.&lt;SEP&gt;Citric acid is a water-soluble compound used to treat phosphogypsum, with an optimum concentration of 4.0% for sample DA and 3.0% for sample HDS.&lt;SEP&gt;Citric acid is a solution used in the solubility chart to measure the dissolution of calcium phosphate compounds.&lt;SEP&gt;An aqueous solution used to treat phosphogypsum samples, with concentrations ranging from 2.0% to 5.0%.&lt;SEP&gt;Citric acid is a weak acid evaluated as an alternative leaching agent for rare earth element recovery from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Citric acid is utilized in an integrated leaching process for recovering rare earth elements from coal fly ash.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1790983599</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
