  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sodium fluoride is a fluoride compound that exhibits maximum solubility in aqueous citric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;A fluoride compound detected in the studied samples.&lt;SEP&gt;A gas phase compound (NaF) that begins to appear between 1200 °C and 1300 °C and increases with temperature.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-007</data>
