  <data key="d0">Dicalcium Phosphate Dihydrate</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Dicalcium phosphate dihydrate is a calcium phosphate compound that shows intermediate solubility in citric acid solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;The full chemical name for the crystalline phase known as brushite, identified in the cement composition.&lt;SEP&gt;A mineral reference pattern also known as Brushite, represented by black vertical tick marks.</data>
