<node id="Setting time">
  <data key="d0">Setting time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Setting time is a physical property tested for in the produced cements.&lt;SEP&gt;Setting time is a key property of cement that is considerably retarded when phosphogypsum is used.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1790961592</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Compressive strength">
  <data key="d0">Compressive strength</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Compressive strength is a physical property tested for in the produced cements.&lt;SEP&gt;Compressive strength is a mechanical property of cement that is reduced when phosphogypsum is used.&lt;SEP&gt;A mechanical property of bioactive carbonate apatite cement that was enhanced via incorporation of silica calcium phosphate composites.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-021</data>
