<node id="Blaine">
  <data key="d0">Blaine</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Blaine is the unit of measurement used to determine the fineness of cement and gypsum plaster.&lt;SEP&gt;Blaine is a method for measuring the fineness of cement, expressed in square meters per kilogram.&lt;SEP&gt;Blaine is a method used to measure the fineness of Portland slag cement.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-002</data>
