  <data key="d5">1790961592</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cement Clinker">
  <data key="d0">Cement Clinker</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cement clinker is a fundamental component combined with slag and gypsum during Portland slag cement production.&lt;SEP&gt;Cement Clinker is a construction industry material produced using calcium oxide derived from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Cement clinker is a target industrial material for which the two-step preparation of phosphogypsum provides theoretical support.&lt;SEP&gt;Cement clinker is a material whose phase formation and calcination process are optimized using calcium sources derived from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Cement clinker is a synthetic material whose quality is monitored using soft sensor modeling.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791089698</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
