<node id="Table 6">
  <data key="d0">Table 6</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Table 6 presents the physical properties of gypsum plaster, including setting time, bulk density, and compressive strength.&lt;SEP&gt;A data table presenting the calculated radium equivalent activity values for phosphogypsum waste samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 6 is a data presentation in the study that lists the calculated total absorbed dose rate values for phosphogypsum waste samples.&lt;SEP&gt;A comparative data table showing water quality parameters, specifically pH ranges, between Gabes and Djerba.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 6 is a reference document cited in the text containing drinking water guidelines for Ra-226.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791188835</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
