  <data key="d0">PSC</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">PSC is an abbreviation for Portland slag cement used in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;A process scenario evaluated in a comparative life cycle assessment table detailing resource and energy inputs.&lt;SEP&gt;PSC is one of three comparative scenarios analyzed in the environmental impact assessment.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-015</data>
