<node id="Hydrothermal Pre-Treatment">
  <data key="d0">Hydrothermal Pre-Treatment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydrothermal pre-treatment is a technique applied to phosphogypsum to induce gypsum re-crystallization and release rare earth elements locked in the lattice.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrothermal Pre-Treatment is a technique involving dehydration that causes gypsum re-crystallization and releases encapsulated rare earth elements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1790983284</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Nitric Acid">
  <data key="d0">Nitric Acid</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Nitric acid is a strong mineral acid studied as an alternative leaching agent for extracting rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A mineral acid utilized in the extraction of rare earth elements from phosphogypsum alongside other acids.&lt;SEP&gt;Nitric Acid is a chemical reagent used in the leaching process to extract rare earth elements from PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Nitric Acid is a leaching agent that shows lower efficiency compared to Hydrochloric Acid for Rare Earth Element extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Nitric Acid is one of the acids evaluated for its efficiency in leaching Rare Earth Elements from Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Nitric acid is a chemical reagent employed for leaching lanthanides from phosphohemihydrate and determining calcium sulfate dihydrate solubility.&lt;SEP&gt;Nitric acid is a chemical present under oxidizing conditions that helps keep 90-95% of uranium in the liquid phase.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-012</data>
