  <data key="d2">The marine environment is an alternative disposal site for untreated phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;The aquatic ecosystem impacted by phosphogypsum dumping, suffering from lowered pH, heavy metal pollution, and disrupted biological growth.</data>
