<node id="R1">
  <data key="d0">R1</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">R1 denotes the chemical reaction equation describing the decomposition of phosphate rock during the wet process.&lt;SEP&gt;R1 is a chemical reaction describing the formation of CaSO4 complex salts.&lt;SEP&gt;R1 is a reaction step involved in the formation and transformation of CaSO4 complex salts during PG impregnation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-013</data>
