<node id="Red Mud">
  <data key="d0">Red Mud</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Red mud is a mining and industrial residue used for the selective extraction of scandium and rare earth elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Red mud is an aluminate-rich material that reacts with calcium sulfates to form ettringite and improve mixture densification.&lt;SEP&gt;Red Mud is an industrial waste material used alongside phosphogypsum and fly ash as a liner for hazardous waste disposal.&lt;SEP&gt;A waste material explored for recycling into low carbon and green cementitious materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Industrial waste material analyzed for comprehensive utilization strategies in China.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-018</data>
