  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A mineral source of rare earth elements located in California and China.&lt;SEP&gt;Bastnaesite is a known Rare Earth Element ore used as a benchmark for comparing the potential value of Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Bastnaesite is a mineral source of rare earth elements found at Mountain Pass and Bayan Obo.</data>
