  <data key="d0">Xenotime</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A mineral source of rare earth elements located in Malaysia and China.&lt;SEP&gt;Xenotime is a mineral source of rare earth elements found at Lehat and Longnan.&lt;SEP&gt;Xenotime is a stable mineral phase where Rare Earth Elements occur independently within Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Xenotime is an undissolved independent Rare Earth Element mineral inclusion found in the leaching residue.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-002</data>
