<node id="Praseodymium">
  <data key="d0">Praseodymium</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Praseodymium is a chemical element whose concentration and enrichment were measured in the samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Praseodymium is a rare earth element measured in WBS and TWBS samples.&lt;SEP&gt;A rare earth metal element that forms a complex with EDTA in the analyzed sample.&lt;SEP&gt;Praseodymium is a rare earth element that dominates the elemental composition of dried PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Praseodymium is a rare earth element selectively recovered from phosphogypsum leachate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-028</data>
