  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">P. Zhang is a researcher who has contributed to multiple studies on the recovery of rare earth elements from phosphate-based resources.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-017</data>
