  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A metric used to evaluate the economic potential and outlook of rare earth element resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Outlook Coefficient is a calculated metric used for resource evaluation, representing the ratio of critical Rare Earth Elements to excessive Rare Earth Elements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-005</data>
