<node id="X-ray Diffraction">
  <data key="d0">X-ray Diffraction</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">X-ray Diffraction is a widely utilized analytical technique primarily designed to obtain diffraction patterns from various samples, which are then analyzed to identify crystalline phases and minerals. By interpreting these patterns, the method accurately determines the main phase composition and detailed mineralogical or crystal structure of the material under investigation. It serves as a fundamental tool for material characterization, enabling researchers and engineers to examine mineralogical evidence and assess the structural properties of diverse substances.

The technique is frequently applied across a range of specific material matrices, including phosphogypsum waste, beneficiated solids, mixed powders, and set cement composites. While it offers robust capabilities for phase identification and structural analysis, X-ray Diffraction has a defined sensitivity limitation, specifically a detection threshold of 10,000 ppm for rare earth elements. Despite this constraint, it remains a standard and indispensable method for evaluating the crystalline composition and mineralogical makeup of complex samples.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray Diffraction is an analytical technique used to characterize the crystalline structure of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A standard representation technique used to display crystallographic structure data in a 3D stacked line plot.&lt;SEP&gt;An analytical method used to determine the mineral composition and phase content of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray diffraction is an analytical technique used to identify mineral compositions such as α-quartz in phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray diffraction is an analytical technique used to identify trace element compounds in evaporated phosphogypsum leachate.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-017</data>
