<node id="Alkaline Treatment">
  <data key="d0">Alkaline Treatment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Alkaline Treatment is a process using mineral bases that favors the beneficiation of rare earth elements in solid phases.&lt;SEP&gt;Alkaline Treatment is a chemical process using Na EDTA to solubilize predominant compounds in Phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-002</data>
