<node id="Sodium Chloride">
  <data key="d0">Sodium Chloride</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sodium chloride is a versatile chemical compound widely recognized as dietary salt, utilized across diverse scientific, industrial, and medical fields. Its applications span from biomedical engineering and materials science to analytical chemistry and industrial processing.

In biomedical engineering, sodium chloride is frequently incorporated as an additive into composite bone cement formulations to significantly modify the material's physical, biological, and mechanical characteristics. Specifically, it is used to adjust the setting time, enhance mechanical strength, increase porosity, and improve bioactivity and ionic supersaturation. The concentration of sodium chloride within these cements is highly variable, with its weight percentage and phase proportion scaling directly with the dosage levels applied across different experimental samples.

Beyond biomedical uses, sodium chloride serves critical roles in industrial and laboratory settings. Industrially, it is employed in specialized solutions to treat phosphogypsum and facilitate the production of rare earth concentrates. In analytical and laboratory environments, it is utilized as an analytical-grade compound that functions as a grinding medium for plant sample preparation and aids in creating standard solutions for vitamin C quantification. Additionally, it acts as a reference standard in diffraction pattern analyses, where its characteristic peaks are typically identified and marked with asterisks in experimental data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791142316</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
