  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">J. Hazard. Mater. is the journal that published the 2019 study on leaching lanthanides from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Hazard. Mater. is a journal that published studies on the ecotoxicity of phosphogypsum and its use in nanoparticle synthesis.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Hazard. Mater. is an academic journal featuring studies on the treatment, characterization, and safe application of phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that published research on sulfurisation gypsum and environmental hazards.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Hazard. Mater. is a scientific journal that published multiple studies on arsenic leaching and metal-bearing sludge characterization.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal publishing research on assessing contributions from binders and solid waste.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal publishing studies on hazardous materials, including fly ash and soil stabilization.</data>
