  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Total Rare Earth Elements represents the aggregate concentration of all REEs in the samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Total rare earth elements represent the sum of rare earth element concentrations in the analyzed samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Total Rare Earth Elements (TREEs) represents the sum of all rare earth elements present in the sample, as defined in the experimental conditions.</data>
