<node id="600 °C">
  <data key="d0">600 °C</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">600 °C is the reduced crystallization temperature of calcium fluoride when doped with Ytterbium and Erbium.&lt;SEP&gt;A temperature threshold at which gas phase HF starts to appear.&lt;SEP&gt;A temperature threshold at which gas-phase HF begins to appear.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-006</data>
