</node>
<node id="Gamma-Ray Measurements">
  <data key="d0">Gamma-Ray Measurements</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Gamma-ray measurements are the analytical technique used to determine the activity concentration of radionuclides in the samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Analytical technique used to determine parent/daughter isotope ratios in phosphogypsum and phosphate rock samples.</data>
