<node id="UNSCEAR">
  <data key="d0">UNSCEAR</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">UNSCEAR is the organization that provides guidelines and conversion factors for calculating absorbed dose rates.&lt;SEP&gt;UNSCEAR is an organization that provides worldwide average activity concentration benchmarks for uranium, thorium, and potassium-40.&lt;SEP&gt;UNSCEAR is an international body that established the recommended safe dose level of 55 nGy/h for workers exposed to gamma radiation.&lt;SEP&gt;UNSCEAR is the United Nations Scientific Committee on the Effect of Atomic Radiation, which published reports on sources and effects of ionizing radiation in 1993 and 2000.&lt;SEP&gt;UNSCEAR is the acronym for the United Nations committee that published a 1977 report on natural radioactivity.&lt;SEP&gt;The United Nations Scientific Committee on the Effects of Atomic Radiation is an organization that reported on radium distribution in the human body.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization cited for the annual effective dose equivalent from natural background radiation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791188710</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Activity Concentration">
  <data key="d0">Activity Concentration</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Activity concentration represents the measured radioactivity levels of radionuclides in becquerels per kilogram.&lt;SEP&gt;Activity concentration is the measured quantity of radioactivity per unit mass, expressed in Bq/kg for the uranium isotopes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-005</data>
