  <data key="d0">Radionuclide Fractionation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The redistribution and separation of uranium series isotopes during the chemical processing of phosphate rock.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-006</data>
