  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The maximum permissible radium equivalent activity limit for safe use in civil applications.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific numerical threshold for Radium Equivalent Activity used to compare against calculated values.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-011</data>
