  <data key="d0">Table 5</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A data table presenting the natural isotopic ratios of uranium isotopes calculated from alpha-particle measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;A reference table summarizing the effects of the phosphogypsum storage process on atmospheric, water, and soil environments.&lt;SEP&gt;A data summary presenting reported radionuclide activities in phosphogypsum from various global locations.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 5 is a data reference listing U-238 series radionuclides present in significant quantities in phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-033</data>
