<node id="N">
  <data key="d0">N</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">N is a variable representing the count rate of Rn-222 at the second measurement after radioactive equilibrium is attained.&lt;SEP&gt;N represents the concentration or activity of a specific element or radionuclide in a sample within the Enrichment Factor equation.&lt;SEP&gt;N is a variable added to the background value to calculate a specific normalization model.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-009</data>
