</node>
<node id="PR">
  <data key="d0">PR</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">PR is a sample group where radioactive ratios remain close to the natural equilibrium ratio.&lt;SEP&gt;PR represents a sample type, likely Phosphoric Acid Residue, used for radionuclide concentration measurements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-012</data>
