  <data key="d0">Becker</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Researcher cited regarding the production percentage of phosphoric acid via the wet process.&lt;SEP&gt;Becker is a researcher cited for data on phosphogypsum discharge into water bodies and production methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Becker is a researcher who reported chemical composition values for phosphogypsum process water.&lt;SEP&gt;Becker is an author who published methods for reducing fluoride, radionuclides, and heavy metals in phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-019</data>
