  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Researchers cited regarding the radioactivity sources and environmental pathways of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Rutherford et al. are researchers who highlighted the need for further clarification on the chemical form and location of Ra-226 in phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-80bac46661a7d25358c897f5feccea99-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-033</data>
