  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Ground-Granulated Blast-Furnace Slag is an industrial by-product generated by the iron and steel industry and used as a sustainable binder.&lt;SEP&gt;Ground-granulated blast-furnace slag is a chemical admixture used as an alternative binder in CPB mixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;Ground-Granulated Blast-Furnace Slag is an industrial by-product generated by the iron and steel industry used in PG Remediation.</data>
