<node id="Limestone">
  <data key="d0">Limestone</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Limestone is a supplementary cementitious material adopted in solidification and stabilization processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Limestone is a common solid form in which calcium carbonate is found.&lt;SEP&gt;Limestone is a natural resource whose quarrying demand is reduced by producing Portland cement from PG.&lt;SEP&gt;Limestone serves as the primary raw material calcined to produce quicklime and is involved in traditional carbonate calcination processes.</data>
