  <data key="d0">Modified Quartz</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Modified quartz is an alternative binder additive that physically optimizes aggregate gradation and enhances mechanical properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Modified Quartz is a supplementary cementitious material adopted in solidification and stabilization processes.</data>
