<node id="PTEs">
  <data key="d0">PTEs</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">PTEs refers to potentially toxic elements that are emitted during industrial processes and accumulate in the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;PTEs refers to potentially toxic elements whose immobilization mechanisms are studied in stabilized PG and CPB mixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;Potentially toxic elements whose immobilization mechanisms and release prediction are key to long-term performance evaluation.&lt;SEP&gt;PTEs refer to potentially toxic elements that are the primary focus of stabilization and immobilization efforts.</data>
