  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">OPC is a typical solidification and stabilization agent used in PG mixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;Ordinary Portland Cement, a traditional binder whose use in PG-based mixtures faces challenges regarding GHG emissions and durability.</data>
