<node id="Ettringite">
  <data key="d0">Ettringite</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Ettringite is a main hydration product of clinker phases that contributes to fluoride immobilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Ettringite is a crystalline hydration product that fills pores and improves the densification of the CPB microstructure.&lt;SEP&gt;Ettringite is a mineral compound formed during hydration that can enhance mechanical strength but may also disrupt Geopolymer structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Ettringite is a mineral compound synthesized from industrial by-products for phosphate removal applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-022</data>
