  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Fluorite is a fluoride mineral found in phosphogypsum that contributes to fluorine leaching.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluorite is a sparingly soluble compound that fluoride tends to precipitate as in CPB mixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;A minor accessory mineral component found in phosphate rock.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluorite is an accessory mineral found in the rock formation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-001</data>
