  <data key="d2">J. Environ. Manage. is a journal publishing research on phosphogypsum pollutant leaching and geochemical characterization.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Environ. Manage. is a journal that published assessments on the environmental impact and management of phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific journal that published a review on resource utilization paths for industrial solid waste.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Environ. Manage. is a scientific journal that published research on recycling phosphogypsum for cement production and its environmental effects.&lt;SEP&gt;J. Environ. Manage. is a scientific journal that published an environmental investigation on phosphogypsum-based road materials.</data>
