<node id="Weathering Process">
  <data key="d0">Weathering Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The weathering process is a transformation mechanism that gradually increases the pH value of PG from strongly acidic to neutral.&lt;SEP&gt;The weathering process is a natural phenomenon that influences the extent of anion substitution in fluorapatite.&lt;SEP&gt;The weathering process is a natural mechanism that redistributes potentially toxic elements and fluorides in phosphogypsum stockpiles.</data>
