  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Phosphate ore is the raw mineral resource processed to extract phosphoric acid, resulting in the generation of phosphogypsum waste.&lt;SEP&gt;A raw material that can be processed using the treated mother liquid from rare earth recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate ore determines the color and composition of Phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate ore is the raw material source that determines the chemical and mineralogical characteristics of phosphogypsum.</data>
