  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A schematic diagram illustrating the three-step process of rare earth element extraction from recycled phosphogypsum samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 8 depicts the undissolved particles remaining after dissolving the gypsum matrix with dilute hydrochloric acid.&lt;SEP&gt;A figure presenting SEM micrographs of the composite bone cements after varying immersion durations in SBF solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Fig. 8 is a figure illustrating the Boren-Haber reaction cycle in the catalytic decomposition of PG.</data>
