  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Stockpile sites are locations where vast amounts of phosphogypsum are produced and dumped, requiring isolation measures.&lt;SEP&gt;Locations where phosphogypsum is dumped, affecting local phosphorus cycles.&lt;SEP&gt;Stockpile sites are locations where phosphogypsum is dumped, leading to adverse effects on authigenic phosphorus content.</data>
