<node id="Step 1">
  <data key="d0">Step 1</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The first step in the REE extraction process, involving diffusion of leachate through the aqueous film.&lt;SEP&gt;Step 1 is the initiating reaction involving PG impregnation and ion exchange processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Step 1 represents the initial stage of PG impregnation involving ion exchange with iron salt solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-013</data>
