<node id="Step 2">
  <data key="d0">Step 2</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The second step in the REE extraction process, involving diffusion of leachate through the product layer.&lt;SEP&gt;Step 2 is the reduction of Fe2(SO4)3 by CO to form FeS.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-013</data>
