</node>
<node id="Step 3">
  <data key="d0">Step 3</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The third step in the REE extraction process, involving the breaking of PG lattice bonding.&lt;SEP&gt;Step 3 is the reduction of CaSO4 by FeS occurring on the PG surface.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-013</data>
