  <data key="d0">Overall Rare Earth Elements Recovery</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Overall rare earth elements recovery is a quantitative metric measuring the percentage of rare earth elements successfully extracted, achieving 52.9 wt% in cycle leaching tests.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791038121</data>
