  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Soluble P2O5 is an impurity present in high-purity gypsum, limited to less than 0.06 wt%.&lt;SEP&gt;Soluble P2O5 is an impurity present in the recovered gypsum, measured at less than 0.06 wt%.</data>
