  <data key="d0">20 µm Scale Bar</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The 20 µm scale bar indicates the microscopic size of the phosphogypsum particles shown in the SEM micrograph.&lt;SEP&gt;A reference line in the SEM micrograph used for size estimation of the crystalline structures.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-022</data>
