<node id="Drying Process">
  <data key="d0">Drying Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Drying Process involves heating dried PG at 70 °C for over 24 hours to determine free water content.&lt;SEP&gt;A thermal process stage in PSC technology that accounts for nearly 40% of coal use, particularly for high-moisture raw materials.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-007</data>
