<node id="Acid Leaching Process">
  <data key="d0">Acid Leaching Process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The acid leaching process is a systematic investigation method used to extract Rare Earth Elements from Phosphogypsum and develop reinforcement strategies.</data>
