<node id="Ultrasonic Impact">
  <data key="d0">Ultrasonic Impact</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Ultrasonic impact is a physical treatment method applied to facilitate the release of Rare Earth Elements from the gypsum matrix.</data>
