<node id="NaCl">
  <data key="d0">NaCl</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">NaCl is a chemical compound whose varying content influences the phase composition and setting time of the bone cements.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical compound added to the cement mixture that influences setting duration and physical characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium chloride is used as an additive and modifier in the composite bone cements to influence microstructure.&lt;SEP&gt;NaCl is a chemical compound used as a modifier in the composite bone cement, influencing grain growth and porosity.&lt;SEP&gt;NaCl is a chemical additive incorporated into composite bone cement to promote a porous structure and influence mechanical performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium chloride additive incorporated into the bone cement synthesis to enhance surface properties and porosity.&lt;SEP&gt;NaCl is a chemical compound used as a control solution and as a salinity component in culture media.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791142316</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="HAP">
  <data key="d0">HAP</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">HAP is a hydroxyapatite phase detected in the x = 0 sample composition of the bone cements.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyapatite is a chemical compound that forms agglomerates which CaS crystals attach to.&lt;SEP&gt;HAP is a compound synthesized in the composite bone cement, contributing to the material's structural matrix.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-010</data>
