  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A specific composite bone cement formulation that exhibited a porous structure, excellent biocompatibility, and over 94.12% cell viability.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-015</data>
