  <data key="d2">A composite bone cement material composed of calcium sulfide, hydroxyapatite, and varying amounts of sodium chloride.&lt;SEP&gt;(0.70CaS–0.30HAP)/xNaCl Composite Bone Cement is a synthetic biomaterial developed for biomedical applications, composed of calcium sulfate, hydroxyapatite, and sodium chloride.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-016</data>
