  <data key="d0">Sodium Chloride (NaCl)</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A chemical compound added to the composite bone cement to modify its physical and functional properties.&lt;SEP&gt;A reference compound used in the XRD pattern analysis, identified by ICDD No. 01-078-0751.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-022</data>
