  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A base material component of the composite bone cement.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical phase identified by black circles in the diffraction graph.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-030</data>
