<node id="Hydroxyapatite (HAP)">
  <data key="d0">Hydroxyapatite (HAP)</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydroxyapatite is a calcium phosphate-based biomaterial and major component of bone inorganic matrix, widely used for bone augmentation and tissue engineering.&lt;SEP&gt;A base material component of the composite bone cement.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-001</data>
