  <data key="d0">Water Absorption</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A physical property of the composite bone cement analyzed to understand its interaction with aqueous media.&lt;SEP&gt;A functional property of the composite bone cement that increases with higher sodium chloride concentration.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-002</data>
