  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Aguilar et al. are researchers who studied beta-tricalcium phosphate scaffolds modified with sodium chloride for improved bioactivity and dissolution control.&lt;SEP&gt;Researchers who reported that porosity levels above 60% facilitate bone cell proliferation and regeneration.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-001</data>
