  <data key="d0">Grain Size</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A microstructural parameter of the composite bone cement measured in micrometers.&lt;SEP&gt;Grain size (d) is a microstructural property that increases with higher NaCl additive concentration and relates exponentially to the elastic modulus.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-012</data>
