  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">EDS is an analytical technique used to identify elemental composition and confirm the successful production of HAP, CaS, and NaCl.&lt;SEP&gt;EDS is an abbreviation for Energy Dispersive X-ray Spectroscopy, used for elemental analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-024</data>
