  <data key="d2">SEM is a microscopy technique used to visualize fracture surfaces and microstructural features like grain size and porosity.&lt;SEP&gt;SEM is a microscopic imaging technique used to analyze the physical structure of PG and Ni/PG carriers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-008</data>
