  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Traditional fabrication techniques that, when combined with nucleation and crystallization methods, greatly improve scaffold interconnectivity.&lt;SEP&gt;Salt Leaching Methods are fabrication techniques used to create porous structures in scaffolds.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-002</data>
