  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Nucleation and Crystallization Methods are techniques used to prepare scaffolds with improved interconnectivity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-011</data>
