</node>
<node id="Compression Tests">
  <data key="d0">Compression Tests</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Compression Tests are mechanical testing procedures used to determine the compressive strength of the composite bone cement.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791060605</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Average Grain Size">
  <data key="d0">Average Grain Size</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Average Grain Size is a microstructural metric that increases with higher NaCl modifier concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;Average grain size is a microstructural metric that increases with NaCl modifier concentration in the composite cements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791060605</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bending Strength">
  <data key="d0">Bending Strength</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A mechanical property investigated using a universal testing machine and ASTM guidelines to assess fracture resistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Bending Strength is a mechanical property that decreases alongside compressive strength with higher NaCl content.&lt;SEP&gt;Bending strength ($\sigma_f$) is a mechanical property measured in MPa, exhibiting an exponential relationship with porosity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791060605</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Elastic Modulus">
  <data key="d0">Elastic Modulus</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Elastic Modulus is a mechanical property calculated using empirical equations to characterize the material's stiffness.&lt;SEP&gt;The E value represents the elastic modulus, which decreases with increasing NaCl additive concentration and shows an exponential relation with grain size.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791060756</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tran et al.">
  <data key="d0">Tran et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Tran et al. are researchers who reported that NaCl fabrication methods increase grain growth and porosity in scaffolds.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791060756</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pokhrel et al.">
  <data key="d0">Pokhrel et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Pokhrel et al. are researchers who found that HAP ceramic from bovine bone yields high porosity and improves bone cement structure.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791060756</data>
