<node id="Apatiteforming Ability">
  <data key="d0">Apatiteforming Ability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Apatiteforming Ability is a biological property of the porous bone cement structure, enhanced by its pore network.</data>
