<node id="Bovine Bone">
  <data key="d0">Bovine Bone</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Natural cow bone waste used as an economical source for synthesizing hydroxyapatite nano-powder.&lt;SEP&gt;Bovine Bone is the source material for the HAP ceramic referenced by Pokhrel et al.&lt;SEP&gt;Bovine bone is a natural source material used to synthesize hydroxyapatite for dental and bone repair applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-017</data>
