<node id="Ringer's Solution">
  <data key="d0">Ringer's Solution</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Ringer's Solution is the physiological liquid medium used as the target for injectability and anti-washout testing.&lt;SEP&gt;A liquid medium used for immersing cement paste to measure weight loss and stability.&lt;SEP&gt;A physiological saline solution used to evaluate the washout resistance and injectability of the cement paste.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-003</data>
