  <data key="d0">Weight Loss</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A measured property indicating the percentage of cement paste lost after immersion in Ringer's solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Weight Loss is the percentage reduction in mass during PG decomposition, used to measure reaction progress.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-012</data>
