<node id="24 Hours">
  <data key="d0">24 Hours</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The setting period required before the cement samples undergo X-ray diffraction phase analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;24 Hours is the duration seeds were prepared and moistened to ensure optimal germination before planting.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-004</data>
