  <data key="d0">Pharatree Jaita</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Pharatree Jaita is a co-author of the research paper on composite bone cements.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharatree Jaita is the primary author responsible for data curation, investigation, methodology, visualization, and original drafting of the research.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-000</data>
