  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Calcium sulfate is a resorbable component used in composite bone cements to modulate setting time and bioactivity.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium sulfate is the primary chemical compound in phosphogypsum that undergoes decomposition in PSC technology.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-002</data>
