  <data key="d0">Nanohydroxyapatite (nHAP)</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Nanohydroxyapatite is a nanostructured form of hydroxyapatite extensively researched in restorative dentistry for its enhanced biomaterial properties.</data>
