  <data key="d0">Hydroxyapatite–calcium sulfate composite bone cement</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A composite bone cement combining hydroxyapatite and calcium sulfate, developed to improve bioactivity, injectability, and mechanical properties for bone repair.</data>
