  <data key="d0">Sodium chloride (NaCl)</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sodium chloride is used as a cationic substitution additive in hydroxyapatite and beta-tricalcium phosphate composites to enhance mechanical strength and bioactivity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-001</data>
