  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Calcium sulfate dihydrate is the primary chemical compound composing the PG sample used in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium sulfate dihydrate is the primary chemical compound composing the PG sample before the gasification process.&lt;SEP&gt;Calcium sulfate dihydrate is the specific chemical compound that constitutes the majority of phosphogypsum.</data>
