  <data key="d2">An oxygen carrier is a material used in CLG to transfer oxygen and facilitate syngas production.&lt;SEP&gt;Oxygen carrier is the functional role of PG in facilitating the chemical looping gasification process by supplying oxygen for fuel conversion.&lt;SEP&gt;Oxygen carrier is the functional role of PG in the chemical looping gasification process.</data>
