  <data key="d0">Yangtze River Economic Belt</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Yangtze River Economic Belt is a geographic region where the environmental management of the Three Phosphorus Industry was studied.&lt;SEP&gt;Yangtze River Economic Belt is a major ecological and economic development zone in China where phosphogypsum distribution and utilization are extensively studied.&lt;SEP&gt;The Yangtze River Economic Belt is the primary geographic region containing a high concentration of phosphogypsum storage facilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A major Chinese region discussed in the context of phosphate resource exploitation and ecological protection.</data>
