  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The 14th Five-Year Plan is a national policy framework in China that guides clean energy transition and sustainable development.&lt;SEP&gt;14th Five-Year Plan is a subsequent policy framework directing the phosphorus chemical industry to further reduce industrial solid waste emissions and storage.&lt;SEP&gt;The 14th Five-Year Plan is a national development strategy influencing phosphogypsum utilization trends.</data>
