  <data key="d2">Coal serves as a primary solid fuel substrate for chemical looping gasification and combustion experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Coal is an energy source consumed in the PBG and PSC technology processes.&lt;SEP&gt;A raw material consumed in PBG and PSC technologies, contributing significantly to environmental impacts like FDP and GWP.&lt;SEP&gt;Coal is a fossil fuel material listed in the energy consumption table.&lt;SEP&gt;A fossil fuel consumed as an energy source in the PBG and PSC process scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;A raw material consumed by PBG and PSC processes, serving as a source of Carbon.&lt;SEP&gt;Coal is a fuel source tracked in the PBG and PSC scenarios.</data>
