  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cement retarders are one of the applications of PG in the construction industry.&lt;SEP&gt;Cement retarders are materials whose conventional production models are constructed based on natural gypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Cement retarders are materials whose substitution rate significantly affects the LCA results of PCR technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Cement retarders are industrial additives whose substitution rate is a key sensitivity factor for the PCR technology environmental impact.&lt;SEP&gt;Cement Retarders are building products utilizing phosphogypsum with sales radii generally limited to within 100 kilometers.</data>
