  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Urban mining is a resource recovery strategy that targets waste streams like phosphogypsum, e-waste, and sewage sludge to reduce environmental pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Urban Mining is a concept focused on recovering resources from various waste streams to reduce pollution.</data>
