<node id="Phosphate Fertilizer Industry">
  <data key="d0">Phosphate Fertilizer Industry</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Phosphate Fertilizer Industry is the primary producer of phosphogypsum and faces sustainability challenges due to overcapacity and waste accumulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The phosphate fertilizer industry is an industrial sector whose operations generate phosphogypsum and drive the need for sustainable waste management and recycling solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Phosphate Fertilizer Industry is the industrial sector that generates Phosphogypsum as a byproduct.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-000</data>
