  <data key="d2">Cold-bonded aggregates are construction materials made from surface-reinforced phosphogypsum, evaluated for macroscopic properties and leachability.&lt;SEP&gt;Cold-bonded aggregates are phosphogypsum-based construction materials studied for their physical properties and strength.</data>
