<node id="World Health Organization">
  <data key="d0">World Health Organization</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">An international health authority that recommends safe concentration limits for fluoride exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;The World Health Organization establishes international concentration limits for hazardous substances to prevent adverse health conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The World Health Organization is an international health agency that publishes drinking water quality guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;An international body whose guideline for beta particle activity was exceeded by lead-210 levels in Alberta phosphogypsum leachate.</data>
