  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Anhui Province is a region with high phosphogypsum utilization due to its advantageous geographical location, large market, and lower production volume.&lt;SEP&gt;Anhui Province is a region within the Yangtze River Basin noted for its high phosphogypsum comprehensive utilization rate.&lt;SEP&gt;Anhui Province is a Chinese region where the utilization and disposal of general industrial solid waste are monitored and regulated.&lt;SEP&gt;Anhui Province is a region in China where industrial solid waste disposal is studied.&lt;SEP&gt;Anhui Province is a region in China capable of absorbing its annual phosphogypsum production through local markets.</data>
