  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Human Health is a biological aspect facing elevated disease risks due to proximity to phosphogypsum stockpiles.&lt;SEP&gt;Human health is negatively impacted by the environmental effects of phosphogypsum storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Human health is indirectly impacted by the long-term accumulation of heavy metals in crops grown near phosphogypsum stockpiles.&lt;SEP&gt;Human Health is an environmental impact category affected by Phosphogypsum disposal and optimization scenarios.</data>
