<node id="Hubei Province">
  <data key="d0">Hubei Province</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Hubei Province is a region with high phosphogypsum utilization rates, second only to Guizhou and Anhui, with significant improvements due to policy implementation.&lt;SEP&gt;Hubei Province is a region within the Yangtze River Basin with significant phosphate rock and phosphorus fertilizer production.&lt;SEP&gt;Hubei Province is a region in China that contains Wuhan, the site of the composting and sampling experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Hubei Province is the leading region in China for phosphogypsum production, representing 37.8 percent of the national total.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-009</data>
