  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Yunnan Province is a region in the Yangtze River basin characterized by relatively low phosphogypsum comprehensive utilization rates.&lt;SEP&gt;Yunnan Province is a region within the Yangtze River Basin with significant phosphate rock and phosphorus fertilizer production.&lt;SEP&gt;Yunnan Province is the second leading region in China for phosphogypsum production, representing 26.8 percent of the national total.</data>
