  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Sichuan Province is a region where phosphogypsum utilization rates have significantly improved following the implementation of comprehensive utilization policies.&lt;SEP&gt;Sichuan Province is a region within the Yangtze River Basin with significant phosphate rock and phosphorus fertilizer production.&lt;SEP&gt;Sichuan Province is a region in China capable of absorbing its annual phosphogypsum production through local markets.</data>
