<node id="Zinc">
  <data key="d0">Zinc</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Zinc is a chemical element classified as both a trace element and a heavy metal, distinguished by its notable enrichment in specific geological and industrial matrices. In natural systems, it is highly concentrated in phosphorites, where it commonly associates with organic matter or metallic sulfide precipitates. Industrially, zinc is a prominent trace element in phosphogypsum, with documented concentration data recorded in micrograms per gram across multiple samples. Its mass content in this byproduct significantly exceeds the Earth's crust average, and it exhibits a transfer rate of 20–49 percent during phosphogypsum processing.

The environmental behavior of zinc is notably pH-dependent, as its concentration decreases substantially alongside cadmium when pH levels rise. From a regulatory perspective, zinc is formally listed in water quality standards tables, where it is subject to specified allowable limits across various water quality categories. One documented standard establishes a concentration limit of 5 mg l⁻¹ for zinc in water. Collectively, these characteristics underscore zinc's significant geochemical presence, its dynamic behavior during industrial processing, and its regulated status in environmental quality assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;Zinc is a metal discharged into freshwater from mining, influencing non-human and ecotoxicity potentials.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-047&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791209442</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
