  <data key="d2">A data table presenting the trace element mass content of phosphogypsum samples from different factories.&lt;SEP&gt;Data table comparing microbial growth values across soil, biofertilizer, and plant root samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 4 is a data table presenting the content of selected chemical elements in phosphogypsum samples.</data>
