<node id="Trace Elements">
  <data key="d0">Trace Elements</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A category of chemical constituents including lead, copper, cadmium, nickel, strontium, zinc, arsenic, uranium, chromium, iron, and fluorine found in the samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Trace elements are dissolved components in phosphogypsum that may remain in a mobile state due to acidity.&lt;SEP&gt;Various chemical elements present in phosphogypsum whose specific forms and solubility controlling solids are under study.&lt;SEP&gt;Elements contained within phosphogypsum that require solubility analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Trace Elements are chemical components taken up by plants from soil and subsequently ingested by humans and animals.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-045</data>
