  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Microbial Communities refer to the diverse populations of microorganisms analyzed during the composting experiment to understand population dynamics and resistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Microbial communities are complex groups of microorganisms whose composition, abundance, and correlations are analyzed across different samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Microbial communities are the assemblages of microorganisms analyzed for coexistence and functional prediction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-009</data>
