  <data key="d2">Soil-dwelling organisms whose available living space is reflected by soil porosity.&lt;SEP&gt;Biological agents whose growth and propagation are promoted by high temperatures and optimal moisture during composting.&lt;SEP&gt;Living organisms whose growth and propagation require proper hydration and specific environmental conditions.</data>
