  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">A bacterial phylum representing 1.68% of the microbial community throughout the composting process.&lt;SEP&gt;Deinococcota is a bacterial phylum that is more abundant in Group A2_1.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-020</data>
