  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Total nitrogen is one of the main parameters analyzed at different stages of the composting process.&lt;SEP&gt;A soil nutrient parameter significantly increased by the addition of biofertilizer.&lt;SEP&gt;Total Nitrogen is a water quality parameter measured using ultraviolet spectrophotometry.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-017</data>
