<node id="Water Content">
  <data key="d0">Water Content</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Water content is maintained between 50% and 60% during composting and measured after drying samples.&lt;SEP&gt;A moisture parameter that decreases due to volatilization during microbial growth and requires constant adjustment.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydration level maintained at approximately 50% in the reactor to support microbial growth.</data>
