  <data key="d0">Pakchoi</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">Pakchoi is a plant used in experiments to test biofertilizer effects, showing significantly higher chlorophyll content when biofertilized.&lt;SEP&gt;Pakchoi is a test plant with a short growth cycle and strong growth performance, used alongside ryegrass in the plant experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Pakchoi is a plant species whose biomass and nutrient content were measured in the experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;A plant species whose growth and yield metrics were measured under different biofertilizer treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Pakchoi is a plant species used as an experimental subject to test biofertilizer effectiveness.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-010</data>
