  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Radon gas is a potential environmental contamination source from phosphogypsum storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Radon Gas is a radioactive gas originating from phosphogypsum that poses significant health risks to humans.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-018</data>
