<node id="Roessler">
  <data key="d0">Roessler</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Roessler is a researcher who reported on radionuclide concentration increases in beneficiated rock and measured U-238 and Ra-226 activities in Florida phosphate ore.&lt;SEP&gt;Roessler is a researcher who summarized the pathways and health risks of radioactive exposure from phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher who reported Rn-222 concentrations near stacks and assessed gamma exposure risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Roessler analyzed radiological hazards of phosphogypsum from central Florida rock and determined gamma radiation and airborne radioactivity exposure levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Roessler conducted a radiological assessment evaluating Radium-226 transfer from phosphogypsum-treated soil to crops and human radiation doses.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-032</data>
