<node id="Working Level">
  <data key="d0">Working Level</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Working Level is a metric describing the potential alpha energy concentration of radon progeny in the air.&lt;SEP&gt;A unit of measurement used to express the maximum dose received by exposed individuals above background levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-026</data>
