  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Phosphoria Formation is a specific geological deposit where trace element enrichment patterns differ from average phosphorites.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphoria Formation is a geological formation containing phosphorites, studied for its compositional features.</data>
