<node id="SENES">
  <data key="d0">SENES</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">An organization that reported particle density and bulk density data for phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;SENES is an organization cited regarding the pH of aged and leached phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;SENES is an organization that reported instances of high radium levels in groundwater systems.&lt;SEP&gt;SENES is a research entity that discussed fluoride monitoring programs in Canada and reported seasonal fluoridation variations.&lt;SEP&gt;A research group that conducted leachate studies on phosphogypsum samples from inactive and active stacks in Ontario and Alberta.&lt;SEP&gt;SENES summarized field studies in Florida and reviewed groundwater studies in Alberta.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization that measured Rn-222 exhalation rates and ambient concentrations at stacks in Ontario and Alberta.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-023</data>
