  <data key="d0">AMAX Phosphate Inc.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">AMAX Phosphate Inc. is a company located in central Florida that operates cooling water systems.&lt;SEP&gt;AMAX Phosphate Inc. is a facility where cooling water sample S2 was collected.&lt;SEP&gt;An operational phosphate plant in central Florida whose stack leachate was summarized by SENES.&lt;SEP&gt;AMAX Phosphate Inc. operated an operational stack in central Florida on limestone bedrock.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-022</data>
