</node>
<node id="Alberta">
  <data key="d0">Alberta</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">A geographic location where phosphogypsum samples from Idaho origin were analyzed for radionuclide activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Alberta is a geographic region referenced in the dataset for radioactive isotope measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;Alberta is a Canadian province with specific maximum air quality guidelines for fluoridation levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Alberta is a region containing phosphogypsum stacks operated by fertilizer manufacturers on glacial till.&lt;SEP&gt;A Canadian province where active phosphogypsum stacks with water-filled ponds were studied.&lt;SEP&gt;Alberta is a region where the radioactivity and chemical characteristics of phosphogypsum were evaluated.&lt;SEP&gt;Alberta is a Canadian province where phosphogypsum tailings decommissioning research was conducted.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-041&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-019</data>
