<node id="Wind Erosion">
  <data key="d0">Wind Erosion</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A process that can release airborne particulate matter from stacks, though often mitigated by crust or moisture.&lt;SEP&gt;Wind erosion is a potential risk when phosphogypsum is broadcast as a fine powder on the soil surface.&lt;SEP&gt;A potential environmental risk when phosphogypsum is broadcast as a fine powder.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-031</data>
