<node id="Collective Risk Assessment">
  <data key="d0">Collective Risk Assessment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A method used to estimate the total risk of fatal cancers to a regional population from radiation exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;Collective risk assessment is a method used to estimate the probability of fatal cancers occurring due to phosphogypsum stacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-026</data>
