  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A health outcome estimated by collective risk assessments related to phosphogypsum stacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Fatal cancer is a health outcome projected by collective risk assessments related to phosphogypsum stack exposure.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-026</data>
