<node id="Silver">
  <data key="d0">Silver</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Silver is a trace element enriched in phosphorites, often associated with organic matter through complexation or adsorption.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemical element with a limit of 0.05 mg l⁻¹ and a WHO guideline value of 0.01 mg l⁻¹.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-047</data>
