  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">A geographic location associated with phosphate rock that yields phosphogypsum with potentially high radionuclide activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Syria is a geographic region referenced in the dataset for radioactive isotope measurements.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-010</data>
