<node id="Th-228">
  <data key="d0">Th-228</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A radionuclide measured in phosphogypsum samples from Australia with a mean activity of 5.8 Bq kg-1.&lt;SEP&gt;Th-228 is a radioactive isotope measured in Australia and Florida with varying concentrations.&lt;SEP&gt;A thorium isotope commonly found in groundwaters.&lt;SEP&gt;Th-228 is a radioactive isotope measured at AMAX, USSAC, Plant A, Plant B, and Plant C.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-022</data>
