</node>
<node id="Phosphate Minerals">
  <data key="d0">Phosphate Minerals</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Mineral forms likely to contain trace elements in phosphogypsum under aerobic, acidic conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphate minerals are a class of compounds studied for their chemical equilibria and behavior in soil environments.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-039</data>
