</node>
<node id="Th-234">
  <data key="d0">Th-234</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Th-234 is a daughter isotope ejected from mineral crystals during U-238 decay, leading to U-234 enrichment in groundwater.&lt;SEP&gt;Thorium-234 is a radioactive isotope that decays into U-234 and can be ejected from mineral crystals into pore water or air.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-012</data>
