  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Ra-228 is a radioactive isotope measured in Hungary with a recorded value of 68.&lt;SEP&gt;Radium-228 is a radioactive isotope combined with Ra-226 in U.S. drinking water standards.</data>
