<node id="Total Dissolved Solids">
  <data key="d0">Total Dissolved Solids</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Total dissolved solids measure the ionic strength of groundwater, which can enhance Ra-226 leachability by competing for adsorption sites.&lt;SEP&gt;Total dissolved solids are present in high levels in the process water.&lt;SEP&gt;Water quality parameter found at elevated levels in groundwater near phosphogypsum stacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Total Dissolved Solids are chemical constituents in the Gypsum Stack that migrate into soil and water systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1791188710</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
