  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Cothern documented that Radon-222 solubility in organic liquids may be several orders of magnitude greater than in water.&lt;SEP&gt;A researcher cited alongside UNSCEAR regarding natural background radiation dose estimates.</data>
