<node id="Partition Coefficient">
  <data key="d0">Partition Coefficient</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Partition coefficient quantifies the distribution of a substance between two phases, measured as 0.35 for Radon-222 between water and air.</data>
