  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Air is a medium where ejected Th-234 atoms accumulate during radioactive decay processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Air is the gaseous phase in the partition coefficient measurement for Radon-222 solubility.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-012</data>
