  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Gross alpha activity is a radiological measurement used to evaluate drinking water contamination levels.&lt;SEP&gt;A radionuclide measurement with a limit of 15 pCi l⁻¹ and a WHO guideline value of 0.1 Bq l⁻¹.</data>
