  <data key="d0">Wet phosphoric acid process</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The wet phosphoric acid process is an industrial manufacturing method that produces approximately five tonnes of phosphogypsum per tonne of phosphoric acid.</data>
