  <data key="d0">Alpha emitting radionuclides</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Alpha emitting radionuclides are radioactive particles considered a greater health concern than beta emitters due to severe biological damage upon inhalation or ingestion.</data>
