  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A fluidized bed calciner is utilized for the low-temperature calcination process in β-building gypsum production.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-002</data>
