  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Global Warming Potential is an environmental impact category where PSC Technology demonstrates the smallest impact, reducing emissions by 13.3 percent.&lt;SEP&gt;An environmental impact metric dominated by carbon dioxide emissions from coal combustion and coke reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Global Warming Potential is an environmental impact category that exhibited higher variability in the PCR and PBG technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Global Warming Potential is an environmental impact indicator measuring greenhouse gas emissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Global Warming Potential (GWP) is a key environmental impact category measured in the comparative analysis.</data>
