<node id="Stockpiling">
  <data key="d0">Stockpiling</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Stockpiling is a common PG disposal method involving the storage of waste material, evaluated against resource utilization technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Stockpiling is a Plaster of Paris disposal process that shows the highest environmental burden due to land occupation and pollutant release.&lt;SEP&gt;Stockpiling is the primary Phosphogypsum disposal method responsible for the majority of environmental impact.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-276f29345df37143fc224a22d0f6089b-chunk-010</data>
