<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Building Materials">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Building Materials and Phosphogypsum indicates that construction products serve as the primary resource utilization pathway for this industrial byproduct. Phosphogypsum is extensively utilized across the building materials sector, typically requiring purification before it is safely incorporated into manufacturing processes. This material is widely employed to produce a variety of construction supplies, specifically gypsum blocks, boards, and cement mortar.

Despite market constraints stemming from public perception, the application of phosphogypsum in construction remains a significant and established practice. Its integration into the building materials industry not only provides a sustainable disposal route but also actively helps alleviate shortages of conventional construction resources. Consequently, the production of purified phosphogypsum for building materials represents a critical industrial application that balances resource recovery with market demands.&lt;SEP&gt;Building materials serve as a primary resource utilization pathway for phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is extensively utilized in the field of building materials despite market constraints driven by public perception.</data>
  <data key="d9">application,industrial application,industrial use,industrial utilization,manufacturing,utilization,utilization field,utilization pathway</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005</data>
