  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Dehydration rehydration is a key mechanism where Phosphogypsum's components transform through water removal and rehydration to form high-performance materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Dehydration rehydration is a key mechanism where Phosphogypsum's components transform through water removal and rehydration to form high-performance materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Dehydration rehydration is a key mechanism where Phosphogypsum's components transform through water removal and rehydration to form high-performance materials.</data>
