<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Calcium Sulfate Dihydrate">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Calcium sulfate dihydrate and phosphogypsum share a fundamental compositional relationship, wherein phosphogypsum is primarily composed of calcium sulfate dihydrate. This compound serves as both the main crystalline structure and the primary chemical constituent of the material, establishing the foundational basis for its identity.

The presence of calcium sulfate dihydrate directly dictates the physical and chemical behavior of phosphogypsum. Structurally, the calcium sulfate dihydrate crystals within phosphogypsum are distinctly marked by parallel striations on their surfaces. Consequently, the material's overall properties and reactivity are intrinsically governed by the abundance and specific morphological features of its calcium sulfate dihydrate component.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is primarily composed of Calcium Sulfate Dihydrate.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical composition,chemical makeup,composition,main component,material identity,primary composition,primary constituent</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e290dd6268316238694f70c30a367426-chunk-018</data>
