<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Sulfuric Acid">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum and Sulfuric Acid share a multifaceted relationship that encompasses both compositional and industrial processing dimensions. Naturally, phosphogypsum contains sulfuric acid as an inherent component, specifically existing as unreacted or residual acid. This residual presence is directly responsible for imparting an acidic nature to the phosphogypsum material.

From an industrial perspective, this compositional relationship is actively utilized through established chemical processing methods. Phosphogypsum serves as the primary raw material for the production of sulfuric acid, leveraging mature solid-solid reaction technology. Through dedicated sulfuric acid processing, the residual acid is recovered and extracted, ultimately yielding sulfuric acid as a valuable byproduct. Thus, the interaction highlights a practical cycle where phosphogypsum functions simultaneously as a carrier of residual sulfuric acid and as a foundational feedstock for its industrial recovery.</data>
  <data key="d9">application,chemical composition,chemical production,contains,contains residual chemical,processing,production,raw material</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-005</data>
