<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Cement">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum is used as a primary calcium oxide source in cement production.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is used as a primary calcium oxide source in cement production.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is proposed for large-scale application in cement production.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum has been historically applied in cement production, though technical bottlenecks hinder widespread promotion.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum can be combined with other solid wastes for large-scale use in cement production.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is utilized to stabilize cement or act as a set retarder in Portland cement production.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is used as a primary calcium oxide source in cement production.</data>
