<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Chemical Raw Materials">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Chemical Raw Materials and Phosphogypsum establishes phosphogypsum as a primary resource utilization pathway for the production of chemical raw materials. This extensive application is primarily driven by the material's rich composition of calcium, sulfur, and oxygen, which make it highly suitable for industrial processing. Through systematic treatment, phosphogypsum is converted into essential chemical raw materials that support a wide range of manufacturing and production activities.

In specific industrial applications, phosphogypsum is processed to manufacture key chemical compounds, most notably sulfuric acid and potassium sulfate, alongside other chemical derivatives. By transforming this material into valuable chemical inputs, the relationship highlights an efficient approach to resource recovery, effectively linking phosphogypsum processing with the broader chemical manufacturing supply chain.</data>
  <data key="d9">application,application field,industrial application,industrial utilization,utilization,utilization field,utilization pathway</data>
