<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Phosphoric Acid">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relationship between Phosphogypsum and Phosphoric Acid is primarily defined by an industrial production pathway where phosphoric acid manufacturing yields phosphogypsum as a major byproduct. Specifically, the wet production process of phosphoric acid generates this material, which inherently retains residual phosphoric acid as a primary impurity. Consequently, the chemical composition of phosphogypsum is directly tied to the phosphoric acid production cycle, containing significant amounts of the acid within its structure.

Beyond its role as a manufacturing byproduct, phosphogypsum also serves as a source for phosphoric acid recovery through chemical processing. Phosphoric acid can be regenerated from the material when phosphate impurities within the phosphogypsum react with aqueous citric acid. This bidirectional interaction underscores a cyclical industrial dynamic, where phosphoric acid production creates phosphogypsum, and the resulting byproduct contains recoverable phosphoric acid that can be extracted under specific chemical conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The production of phosphoric acid generates approximately five tonnes of phosphogypsum per tonne of acid.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains residual phosphoric acid which contributes to its acidic nature.</data>
  <data key="d9">by-product,byproduct,byproduct of,composition,contains,contains residual chemical,impurity,impurity conversion,production,production byproduct,reaction product</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-001</data>
