<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Phosphorus">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Phosphogypsum and Phosphorus encompasses significant industrial, chemical, and environmental dimensions. Phosphogypsum is an industrial byproduct characterized by highly enriched phosphorus levels, a presence that serves as a definitive identifier for the material. Industrially, it functions as a key source for recovering phosphorus, a critical mineral that underpins global supply chains. Despite its economic value, the phosphorus within phosphogypsum is frequently classified as a harmful component that necessitates proper solidification to ensure safe handling and storage.

Environmentally and agriculturally, the interaction between phosphogypsum and phosphorus presents a complex duality. When phosphogypsum is stockpiled or dumped, it can adversely alter authigenic phosphorus content at those sites. Additionally, precipitation events can facilitate the leaching and export of phosphorus from the material into adjacent waterways, raising ecological concerns. Conversely, when utilized in agriculture, phosphogypsum acts as a direct phosphorus source for soils, with high application rates significantly boosting available soil phosphorus. Consequently, the Phosphogypsum-Phosphorus relation highlights both the material's potential as a valuable resource and its requirement for careful environmental management.</data>
  <data key="d9">composition,confirmation,contains,contains harmful component,environmental impact,nutrient source,resource recovery,soil supplementation,supply chain</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a7ec54d376b079eceb4eab9d1f23165e-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2eed3e4bb65f425c7011f91fbc1c7dd5-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20b5888df3bfef8e98cc13abb005b7f0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-033</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1791190308</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
