<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Calcium">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation between Calcium and Phosphogypsum is defined by calcium's status as a primary, dominant, and high-mass-fraction constituent within the material. Its consistent presence across multiple analytical studies serves as a key identifier that confirms the substance's identity as phosphogypsum. Within this composition, the calcium is frequently characterized as chemically activated, which enhances its reactivity and utility. From a processing perspective, calcium can be successfully recovered from phosphogypsum through the application of a preparative vertical-flow electrophoresis system.

In agricultural and environmental applications, phosphogypsum functions as a significant source of calcium for plant nutrition. The material is actively utilized in soil reclamation efforts, where the calcium displaces excess sodium and hydrogen ions to facilitate soil improvement. Collectively, these characteristics underscore calcium's integral chemical role in phosphogypsum and its practical value in both material verification and sustainable soil management.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical activation,chemical composition,chemical constituent,chemical extraction,composition,confirmation,contains,elemental makeup,measurement,nutrient source,nutrient supply,primary composition,resource recovery,soil supplementation,source</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-ce9090f230bcd0bfeefe92db7a576442-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-983b2c3f393a1de00521565a70363819-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-401b567da916dc34559e0bfe5a5b367b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b8bd3776c87a0bcab21842e8e2bb2e06-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a3ac199714be8fd1cdff8ead90fc92-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbe0ad1b5f7f65c2338dc42cd9ca4b89-chunk-029</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
