<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Citric Acid">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum is purified using an aqueous citric acid solution to remove impurities.&lt;SEP&gt;Citric acid is used to treat phosphogypsum, effectively reducing residual impurities such as phosphorus pentoxide and fluorine.&lt;SEP&gt;Citric acid is evaluated as a weak acid leaching agent for rare earth elements from phosphogypsum.</data>
  <data key="d9">extraction research,impurity removal,leaching agent,purification treatment,treatment</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26bca3d4f742299ce2dbcd6381558f89-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1790984561</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Portland Cement">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Purified phosphogypsum is used as a raw material in the manufacture of Portland cement.&lt;SEP&gt;The addition of phosphogypsum to Portland cement considerably retards setting times and reduces compressive strength.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum affects the setting and mechanical properties of Portland cement.&lt;SEP&gt;Soluble components in phosphogypsum influence the hydration process of Portland cement.</data>
  <data key="d9">hydration interaction,material compatibility,material interaction,material substitution,property alteration,property modification,raw material for</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3152ce135edc56e14c47e05535e05c7-chunk-024</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1791091263</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Portland Slag Cement">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Purified phosphogypsum is used as a raw material in the manufacture of Portland slag cement.&lt;SEP&gt;The addition of phosphogypsum to Portland slag cement similarly alters its mechanical and setting properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermally treated phosphogypsum influences the physical properties of Portland slag cement.</data>
  <data key="d9">material substitution,property alteration,property modification,raw material for</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-001fe856b0d193d82422dc8a5baedc86-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-018</data>
