<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Cemented Paste Backfill">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Cemented Paste Backfill is applied as an in-situ solution to manage and remediate Phosphogypsum stockpiles.&lt;SEP&gt;Cemented paste backfill is a conventional technique that utilizes phosphogypsum for in-situ immobilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Cemented paste backfill utilizes phosphogypsum for the retention of phosphorus and fluorine.&lt;SEP&gt;Cemented paste backfill is a remediation application that utilizes phosphogypsum.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum is incorporated into cemented paste backfill mixtures, where its properties directly influence the final mixture's mechanical performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Cemented Paste Backfill mixtures utilize Phosphogypsum for storage, balancing consumption with exposure risks.</data>
  <data key="d9">application,component,material composition,mixture formulation,remediation,retention,storage application,utilization</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1791023386</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Ordinary Portland Cement">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Ordinary Portland cement serves as the primary binder for treating phosphogypsum, facilitating its solidification and stabilization.</data>
  <data key="d9">binder,remediation</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-d1ffdf413ee3cbdda92474adf77e2c78-chunk-008</data>
