<edge source="Phosphogypsum" target="Radium">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Phosphogypsum contains radium, a radioactive element that poses environmental risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains radium, with studies estimating that 89% remains incorporated in its crystal structure.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains radium, a key factor in leaching and environmental impact assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains radium, which requires specific removal processes and environmental monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphogypsum contains radium as a naturally occurring radioactive component.</data>
